UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Antonio helped refine the details pertaining to my child support obligations. I found him very responsive. He also approached the situation in a collaborative manner, doing his best to see both sides and guide the process. This allowed the amendment to be completed without aggression. I would recommend working with Antonio.","author":"","url":"https://a-circelli-law.ca/testimonials/"},{"text":"Antonio was basically our saving grace in a messy custody battle. During our consult he took the time to hear our story and ensured us he had the knowledge to help us. He did not disappoint. He was knowledgeable, always prepared, and made us feel important.","author":"","url":"https://a-circelli-law.ca/testimonials/"},{"text":"I am extremely fortunate and grateful to have had Antonio Circelli represent me in what was a long and contentious separation and divorce process. His guidance, dedication, commitment and genuine concern led to what ultimately became a balanced and fair resolution, without the need for trial. Thank you Antonio.","author":"","url":"https://a-circelli-law.ca/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'a-circelli-law-guelph' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had a great experience working with Akash and his employees for my recent first home purchase. Everything was explained clearly, and the process was handled efficiently from start to finish.","author":"","url":"https://adhillonlaw.com/"},{"text":"I referred a friend to Akash Dhillon and it was an outstanding experience. As a Criminal Lawyer, he demonstrates a deep understanding of the law and a strategic approach to every case. His calm, confident demeanor and attention to detail gave me peace of mind during a stressful time. I would strongly recommend him to anyone facing criminal charges.","author":"","url":"https://adhillonlaw.com/"},{"text":"If you''re looking for a Criminal Lawyer who is sharp, dependable, and truly committed to his clients, look no further than Akash Dhillon. He handled my matter with professionalism and urgency, always keeping me informed and confident throughout the process. His results speak for themselves - highly recommended.","author":"","url":"https://adhillonlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'a-dhillon-law-brampton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"My property was sold in 20 days of listing and I was not sure on who to use to do my real estate paperwork, I was recommended by a friend of mine to use Steve. I had a very professional and quick dealing with Steve Mattoo. I will highly recommend him to everyone.","author":"","url":"https://mattoolaw.com/"},{"text":"I used Amrik as my Real estate lawyer when I bought my house, He did a great job in explaining how the paper work process works and I had a smooth process of buying the new house. Great Job.. He definitely would get my recommendation.","author":"","url":"https://mattoolaw.com/"},{"text":"I was nervous about the purchase of my new house but Mr. Mattoo made me feel at ease. I found his staff to be competent and very professional. I would recommend his services to anybody who is buying or selling a house.","author":"","url":"https://mattoolaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'a-s-mattoo-and-associates-law-office-kamloops' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Mark Kim was amazing, his knowledge of family law and his compassion made this difficult period more tolerable. Both myself and ex were put at ease during the process. Highly recommend Mark.","author":"P.P.","url":"https://www.familylawyerdivorcetoronto.com/client-testimonials/"},{"text":"Mark assisted me with my separation proceedings. He was always professional and non-judgemental. I had absolutely no experience with the situation and he was very patient at explaining every step to me. I would recommend his services to those able to access them.","author":"S.P.","url":"https://www.familylawyerdivorcetoronto.com/client-testimonials/"},{"text":"Excellent experience and interactions with the team here. Mark put me at ease numerous times and had my back 100% of the way. I always felt confident with the advice and services and my overall impression is overwhelmingly positive. I hope I never need another lawyer again, but I will recommend the Aaries team to any of my friends.","author":"C.K.","url":"https://www.familylawyerdivorcetoronto.com/client-testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'aaries-family-law-kingston' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"SMOOTH FIRST LMIA : Our company hired Lev Abramovich to apply for our first Labour Market Impact Assessment, after we were not able to find a domestic candidate with the right skillset. Lev provided excellent guidance throughout the process. His comprehensive LMIA application lead to a positive opinion being issued. I find Lev to be direct, knowledgeable, and responsive.","author":"","url":"https://atimmigrationlaw.com/"},{"text":"TOGETHER AGAIN : We hired Lev Abramovich after unsuccessfully applying for a visitor visa for a family member. Lev reviewed the previous application as well as the officer’s notes and outlined a clear strategy for the new application, which addressed the officer’s concerns. Despite the initial rejection, Lev’s carefully drafted submissions helped our family obtain a visitor visa.","author":"","url":"https://atimmigrationlaw.com/"},{"text":"URGENT INTRA-COMPANY TRANSFER : We retained Abramovich Immigration Law to prepare an urgent intra-company transfer application in the midst of COVID-19. Lev and Ksenia provided our company with first-rate guidance, assessing our options and setting out a clear path forward.","author":"","url":"https://atimmigrationlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'abramovich-immigration-law-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Affordable, professional and experienced. I have used these guys for years and they always get the very best outcome. I have used many other ticket lawyers and I have to write this review to help others. This team is the real deal.","author":"","url":"https://acostalegalservices.com/"},{"text":"Acosta Legal Services with Mr. Acosta and Mr. Gill provided brilliant and professional representation throughout the process leading up to the trial and the trial itself. I was charged under the HTA with the offence of careless driving and as a result of their efforts and representation the charge was withdrawn by the court at the trial stage.","author":"","url":"https://acostalegalservices.com/"},{"text":"Can''t say much more than the results that they were able to produce for me, withdrawn. Great experience overall, easy to get started and nothing that I had to worry about. Everything was taken care of, especially the ticket. They were able to get the results that I wanted, so no complaints from me.","author":"","url":"https://acostalegalservices.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'acosta-legal-services-north-york' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Advocate Law goes above and beyond for anyone! Very easy to get a hold of and will answer as many questions u have. Always made me feel comfortable! Highly recommend.","author":"Dozha F.","url":"https://www.advocatelawyers.ca/"},{"text":"My experience with Laura was amazing! She put in so much hard work, she never gave up and was truly resilient! I''m super impressed. Thanks Laura you definitely helped this family out.","author":"Hailey B.","url":"https://www.advocatelawyers.ca/"},{"text":"Laura did an amazing job representing my son! She was personable, responsive and really seemed to care about his case. Because of her hard work, my son doesn''t even have a criminal record. I highly recommend her and the rest of the lawyers at Advocate Law.","author":"Cari T.","url":"https://www.advocatelawyers.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'advocate-law-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
