UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I retained Clifford Andrew Sukhai of CAS Law for a civil matter. His advice was clear and practical, and the process was efficient, deliberately strategic, and well organized. I would recommend Clifford to anyone looking for solution-focused counsel.” Donald Blumer Entrepreneur/Business Owner","author":"","url":"https://caslaw.ca/"},{"text":"Clifford supported us with our corporate and contractual matters. He was consistently responsive and helped us turn legal considerations into practical business decisions. I would recommend him to companies looking for straightforward, business-minded counsel.” Warren Hall CFO, LOK Energy Services Inc","author":"","url":"https://caslaw.ca/"},{"text":"We engaged Mr. Sukhai as our corporate counsel on a monthly retainer. His work has been thorough, and his communication is timely and easy to follow. He has supported ECO Canada with regulatory compliance, contractual matters, corporate governance, and the review of our Environmental Law training module ensuring that it is relevant and updated.","author":"","url":"https://caslaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'caslaw-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Avi worked with my wife and I to develop wills that reflect accurately our final wishes. The entire experience was handled with kindness, compassion and sincerity on his part. We realize wills and powers of attorney are sensitive issues to which one must attend and our recommendation of Avi is heartfelt and true.” Google Reviewer","author":"","url":"https://charneylegal.ca/"},{"text":"Avi Charney was excellent to deal with when my husband and I purchased our first home. His use of modern technology helped us sign paperwork and transfer funds easily…” Google Reviewer","author":"","url":"https://charneylegal.ca/"},{"text":"Charney Legal is the best Real Estate legal services corporation I had the pleasure of doing Business with. Mr. Charney was professional, knowledgeable & efficient.” Google Reviewer","author":"","url":"https://charneylegal.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'charney-legal-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I’m so happy to finally receive my eCOPR today! I couldn’t have done it without the incredible support of Max and Lisa. They are truly professional, knowledgeable, and dedicated. Throughout the entire immigration process, they were always patient, responsive, and provided clear guidance every step of the way.","author":"","url":"https://chaudharylaw.com/"},{"text":"My case was ultimately successful with the outstanding help and representation provided by Loughlin, and the result has had a life-changing impact on both me and my family. I sincerely thank him for helping me through one of the most difficult periods of my life.","author":"","url":"https://chaudharylaw.com/"},{"text":"I had a very positive experience working with Mr. Loughlin Adams-Murphy throughout my PR journey. The whole process took a long time, but he was always professional, patient, supportive, and responsive whenever I had questions or concerns. I would highly recommend him to anyone looking for a knowledgeable and trustworthy immigration lawyer.","author":"","url":"https://chaudharylaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'chaudhary-law-office-north-york' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I recently worked with Clark and Clark for my mortgage refinancing, and I couldn''t be more pleased with the experience. Their team was incredibly efficient and professional throughout the entire process. Not only did they manage to handle everything smoothly, but they also closed the refinancing three days ahead of the original scheduled date.","author":"","url":"https://clarklegal.com/"},{"text":"We had the pleasure of working with Clark & Clark, and I can''t recommend them highly enough! From start to finish, their team was incredibly professional, knowledgeable, and responsive. They made what could have been a complicated real estate transaction feel seamless and stress-free. Their attention to detail and commitment to ensuring our best interests were protected was truly impressive.","author":"","url":"https://clarklegal.com/"},{"text":"The team at Clark & Clark have always been fantastic. They''ve helped us process four different home sales/purchases and always communicate effectively and get our information processed quickly. We have especially enjoyed working with their paralegal, Amy! She is incredibly thorough and very responsive.","author":"","url":"https://clarklegal.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'clark-and-clark-lawyers-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"From the first day that I met Alastair, he was friendly and I explained my situation and the strategy for winning our Spousal Sponsorship Appeal. He told me that money is not the focus and he only wanted to know the issues.","author":"","url":"https://www.clarkeimmigrationlaw.ca/"},{"text":"In my twelve (12) years working within immigration, Alastair is the most genuine and trustworthy lawyer that I have worked with. He truly cares about his clients. His demeanour and personality enable clients to develop trust and confidence in his abilities. He is extremely knowledgable in the immigration field and ensures that he achieves the best results for his clients.","author":"","url":"https://www.clarkeimmigrationlaw.ca/reviews/"},{"text":"My husband is coming to Canada! Thank you for helping is with the Spousal Sponsorship Appeal at the tribunal. I can’t wait to tell everyone who needs an immigration lawyer, that I found a great one! I will refer them to you. 100% percent sure! You did such a good job! Thank you very much!","author":"","url":"https://www.clarkeimmigrationlaw.ca/reviews/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'clarke-immigration-law-winnipeg' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I highly recommend Amedeo Clivio, after many visits to different lawyers and many negatives found along the way, Amedeo saw what many did not, he took the reins of my case which ended in success. His preparation, empathy and commitment to his work is indisputable. For which I will always be grateful. Diana Vivas","author":"","url":"https://www.cliviolaw.com/"},{"text":"I was extremely impressed with everything. I wanted to leave this comment to give special thanks to my lawyer, Meera. From the beginning to the end of my PR process, she patiently answered all my questions instantly. She was very friendly in every meeting. She managed my whole process perfectly with his knowledge and professionalism.","author":"","url":"https://www.cliviolaw.com/"},{"text":"I am extremely satisfied with Clivio’s services. Ever since the beginning, of our process me and my husband were in different countries, me in Canada and him in El Salvador.","author":"","url":"https://www.cliviolaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'clivio-law-professional-corporation-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
