UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had an excellent experience working with Carlo. He is highly professional, knowledgeable, and detail-oriented. He explained every step clearly and made sure I felt confident and informed throughout the entire process. I truly appreciate his dedication and responsiveness.","author":"","url":"https://ottawainjury.ca/"},{"text":"From day 1 of my father’s case, the professionals at this office were outstanding in service and understandings. My dad’s lawyer Brent Meadows made our life so much easier and better throughout the entire process. Thank you for everything","author":"","url":"https://ottawainjury.ca/"},{"text":"I am grateful to have had Erica McCarney as my lawyer. Her expertise, guidance, and professionalism, as well as her patience and empathy were greatly appreciated. She made me feel seen and heard with real sincerity. Thank you Erica!","author":"","url":"https://ottawainjury.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'david-hollingsworth-and-associates-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I''ve been a client of Michael Day for years. He''s very knowledgeable and professional. He''s been involved in numerous real estate closings and other legal matters for my family. Would definitely recommend him!","author":"","url":"https://dayborg.com/"},{"text":"I found Mr. Day very knowledgeable and fair in our business negotiations. I have used Mr. Day in family law, estate planning, real estate and in our optometric business. I find his fees reasonable. He is easy to talk to and has many resources. I would highly recommend him.","author":"","url":"https://dayborg.com/"},{"text":"Mike Day is a very competent lawyer with very high work ethics. I have recommended him on many occasions.","author":"","url":"https://dayborg.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'day-borg-llp-mississauga' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Great team, we have sold, bought and refinanced with this law firm and every time our transactions were very smooth. We are always very happy with Stan de Krupe and his team, highly recommended!!","author":"","url":"https://dekrupelaw.ca/"},{"text":"Loved the team, we were buying and selling, nothing short of excellent. Stan and Eva were great at answering all the questions and we could not be happier!!","author":"","url":"https://dekrupelaw.ca/"},{"text":"Very pleased with amazing and professional De Krupe Law service during my recent buy/sell. Special thanks to Stan, Eva and Sinthuja (and the other team) for all your prompt reply to my inquiries and all your assistance during my buy/sell journey in this Spring. Just keep it up!","author":"","url":"https://dekrupelaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'de-krupe-law-north-york' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"My experience with Deborah Todd has been incredibly positive. Deborah knows her stuff and is easy to work with. She is sensitive to my needs and keeps things going smoothly and is completely professional at all times. I have no reservations about recommending her to friends and colleagues.","author":"","url":"https://www.deborahtoddlaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"Deborah Todd and team are highly skilled in family law. They take a practical, no-nonsense approach that is in the best interest of their clients. We highly recommend Deborah Todd.","author":"","url":"https://www.deborahtoddlaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"Deborah Todd has been my lawyer for many years and has always dealt with me in a professional, courteous manner. Initially Deborah set up wills for my husband and me, and now our children have gone to Deborah to have their wills done as well. Recently Deborah helped me through the process of being an Executrix for two estates.","author":"","url":"https://www.deborahtoddlaw.com/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'deborah-todd-law-corporation' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had the pleasure of working with Hailee Barber, she is absolutely amazing! Very knowledgeable, honest, and compassionate, she will steer you in the right direction without making you feel like you are stuck between a rock and a hard place.","author":"","url":"https://dsfamilylaw.ca/reviews"},{"text":"Aditya and Aimee helped me with a difficult divorce, much more than any other law professionals in the past. Their service was timely, professional, and thorough. Our conversations and interactions in working through everything felt like I mattered and this \"wasn''t just another case\".","author":"","url":"https://dsfamilylaw.ca/reviews"},{"text":"I got the result I wanted from Mark. He made a tough situation bearable. Divorce is tough to go through but Mark eased the way. Sue was kind and professional. Any questions or concerns I had Sue responded back to me quickly. She was very kind and sympathetic to my situation.","author":"","url":"https://dsfamilylaw.ca/reviews"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'demas-schaefer-family-lawyers-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Lisa is very knowledgeable and a pleasure to deal with, she saved us big time!","author":"","url":"https://denhamlawoffice.com/"},{"text":"For anyone looking for a Kamloops Lawyer, I would recommend Lisa. She is very personable and friendly and also a top real real estate lawyer. Thanks to Lisa, Amber and Shelley for making my home purchase so painless.","author":"","url":"https://denhamlawoffice.com/"},{"text":"Professional, personal, exceptional team. They eased our minds and stress with the sale and purchase of our homes. Kudos to all!!","author":"","url":"https://denhamlawoffice.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'denham-law-office' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Deutschmann de Koning are personal injury lawyers who represented me in a successful motorcycle accident claim. They were very competent and professional and I would use them again without hesitation.","author":"John H.","url":"https://www.ddinjurylaw.com/"},{"text":"My case was handled with excellent communication and regard for my well being. Nick and his team kept me well informed on the progress of my case and provided great advice to bring my litigation to a successful conclusion. I highly recommend Deutschmann de Koning Personal Injury Lawyers.","author":"Diane R.","url":"https://www.ddinjurylaw.com/"},{"text":"Met with Nick recent and quickly met Rob as I was going in their office and for lawyers they are very down to earth guys and very helpful and very friendly. And sure just start with them but I have a good feeling about it all...","author":"Kw N.","url":"https://www.ddinjurylaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'deutschmann-de-koning-law-kitchener' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had a fantastic experience working with Barinder as our real estate lawyer. He was incredibly helpful throughout the entire process, always available to answer our questions and provide clear guidance. He made sure all documents were in order well ahead of our closing dates, which helped us avoid any delays or last-minute issues.","author":"","url":"https://www.dhasilaw.com/"},{"text":"I had an excellent experience working with this lawyer throughout my mortgage process. They were knowledgeable, patient, and took the time to explain everything clearly so I always felt confident about each step. Communication was prompt and professional, and they made what could have been a stressful process feel smooth and straightforward.","author":"","url":"https://www.dhasilaw.com/"},{"text":"Dhasi Law Firm was fantastic to work with for my home sale and purchase closings. They were transparent, responsive, and guided me through every step of the process. Everything was handled smoothly and on time. Highly recommend!","author":"","url":"https://www.dhasilaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dhasi-law-family-lawyer-brampton-brampton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"very good experience with mam. give genuine advice. I recommend it to everyone. THANK YOU","author":"","url":"https://dhimanlaw.com/"},{"text":"I strongly recommend Dhiman Law. They are amazing and reasonable. They accepted my matter with a very tight deadline, and it was reassuring to know that they didn''t view me as simply another file. Really happy with their professional services.","author":"","url":"https://dhimanlaw.com/"},{"text":"Mrs. Inderjit is very professional and helpful. She provided me excellent service even on a short notice. I wanted a letter, and she had kept all the details already drafted and ready which helped me saved my time too.","author":"","url":"https://dhimanlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dhiman-law-professional-corporation-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Over 1,000 5-Star Google reviews These injury lawyers are excellent. Communication was very good and they always made sure I understood everything that was going on throughout the whole procedure. I was very satisfied with the settlement and payment was very prompt after resolution. Thank you D & D! C.W. See All Testimonials","author":"","url":"https://diamondlaw.ca/"},{"text":"These injury lawyers are excellent. Communication was very good and they always made sure I understood everything that was going on throughout the whole procedure. I was very satisfied with the settlement and payment was very prompt after resolution. Thank you D & D!","author":"","url":"https://diamondlaw.ca/"},{"text":"I was very scared and anxious about dealing with my matter because I dont know anything about the law. I spoke with Joel Mcleish and he was very comforting and kind. He made all my worries go away and was very helpful. He was always available if I had a question and he talked me through the entire process...","author":"","url":"https://diamondlaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'diamond-and-diamond-lawyers-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐I got my friend’s doubts cleared here, and the experience was excellent! The staff was very helpful, friendly, and professional. Everything was explained clearly, and my friend was really satisfied with the service. Highly recommended!","author":"","url":"https://www.dietrichlaw.ca/"},{"text":"Dietrich Law Office was so great to work with over the last couple of years. They not only made a very hard time, easier, but they''re communication, staff and work was amazing. I would recommend their office to anyone in need of assistance during a hard time.","author":"Jenna G.","url":"https://www.dietrichlaw.ca/"},{"text":"The whole experience with our situation was very well handled by Dietrich Law and their excellent staff. They were there every step of the way and made a difficult situation much easier to go through. A sincere thank you to George, Lena, Cathy and Connor for their help and professionalism. Thank you again.","author":"Bill B.","url":"https://www.dietrichlaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dietrich-law-office-kitchener' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"We had a wonderful experience with Diversitas Law Group for our permanent residence application. Selvin Mejia handled our case with professionalism, expertise, and kindness, and was always available to answer all our questions and help us with every step along the way.","author":"","url":"https://www.dlawgroup.ca/"},{"text":"Diversitas Law Group helped me with my permanent residence and made the entire process easy and seamless. Selvin made us feel supported at every step of the way and went above and beyond to help us throughout the process. I highly recommend them! Maria Carolina Lasso","author":"","url":"https://www.dlawgroup.ca/"},{"text":"I sought an immigration advice from Ahmad Barzak, and he was brilliant. He helped my wife and I so much in obtaining my work permit and her visitor visa. I seriously cannot be more grateful for such knowledgeable and professional lawyer! Omar Anwar","author":"","url":"https://www.dlawgroup.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'diversitas-law-group-london' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Nothing but good things to say about Mr Dolgin. He worked hard to get me through a difficult divorce. He was conscious of budget and did his best to avoid unnecessary expenses. He was very sharp presenting arguments in court and I was impressed with his knowledge. I’d highly recommend him.","author":"","url":"https://dolginfamilylaw.ca/reviews/"},{"text":"I used the family law legal services of Jeremy Dolgin to represent me in a very long drawn out contentious separation and divorce case. Of the 4 lawyers and firms used over a 4 year period it was only the skills of Mr.","author":"","url":"https://dolginfamilylaw.ca/reviews/"},{"text":"I would recommend Jeremy Dolgin to anyone who requires a family lawyer. Jeremy wasted no time in creating a game plan to ensure we pick the right legal battles in the most cost efficient manner.","author":"","url":"https://dolginfamilylaw.ca/reviews/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dolgin-family-law-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I spoke to Phil and he helped me through a legal situation in which I was scared, he provided excellent advice and a sense of comfort through the situation that I was so unfamiliar with.","author":"","url":"https://dominioncd.com/"},{"text":"I spoke with Philip today as a free consultation. He was amazing, very knowledgeable and extremely truthful, for a free consultation. He even went above and beyond to make sure I was as knowledgeable as I could be, and even spoke to me when his office was closed. If Dominion criminal defense goes this above and beyond for free.","author":"","url":"https://dominioncd.com/"},{"text":"Phillip Dinis is the man! I came in with my problem and he had no problem sitting down for an hour and a half long phone call, tending to my concerns. He understood my situation and walked me through every single step, informed me of my rights and what to do in detail in all scenarios.","author":"","url":"https://dominioncd.com/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dominion-criminal-defence-london' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Honestly I wish there was more stars to check ! Tim and his team are absolutely amazing by far! The predicament I had myself in basically would have ruined me and my life for a long time but through there negotiations and experience Tim got me the best outcome I could possibly get!","author":"","url":"https://www.dunlapcriminaldefencelawyer.com/"},{"text":"We are very thankful that we contacted and used Mr Dunlap to defend our son. All charges were dropped and no record. He was there for us when ever we needed a question answered. It was along 3 years but we are very grateful that he was the lawyer that we used. Thank you again so very much!!","author":"","url":"https://www.dunlapcriminaldefencelawyer.com/"},{"text":"Can not express how very greatfull my family and I are for your time and dedication to my sons defense. Today we were Not Guilty. Thank you soo so so much!!","author":"","url":"https://www.dunlapcriminaldefencelawyer.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'dunlap-criminal-defence-lawyer-edmonton-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"LIZ Hughes “We hired Mr East last year for my son’s criminal case. We were nervous about the entire situation as we had never had any type of experience with any type of legal matter like this. Mr East reassured us that the law would be on our side.","author":"","url":"https://eastlaw.ca/reviews/"},{"text":"Aidan Millar “John East is a true professional. His genuine care for his clients shows in every element of what he does, and he stops at nothing to provide the most thorough, supportive, and just outcomes for those he serves. The advice he provided me has been invaluable and I would recommend John East to anyone, anytime.","author":"","url":"https://eastlaw.ca/reviews/"},{"text":"Bobbie boom “If you are looking for a skilled, professional, and trustworthy criminal defense lawyer, I highly recommend John. From the very first consultation, he was knowledgeable, honest, and incredibly reassuring during a very stressful time. He goes above and beyond for his clients.","author":"","url":"https://eastlaw.ca/reviews/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'east-law-hamilton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Rory is the man who gets things done! He is an absolute force in the courtroom, and he truly cares about the wellbeing of his clients. AND HE WINS! I will recommend him to any person I meet in need of incredible legal counsel. I can genuinely say I was impressed with his unrelenting prowess and determination.","author":"Julianne","url":"https://edmontoncriminallawyerziv.com/"},{"text":"Had Yago Medeiros representing me in a traffic case for distracted driving. It was a 4 month battle but he got a not guilty verdict and no fines or demerit points. Very happy with the results. Would use again and definitely recommend to others.","author":"Jas","url":"https://edmontoncriminallawyerziv.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'edmonton-criminal-lawyer-ziv-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I highly recommend Adam and his team if you are looking for top representation. Adam gets the job done. He is smart, compassionate and has a very sharp legal mind. He has a strong work ethic and I would not hesitate in referring him to others. Thanks Adam, for your help. It is much appreciated!!","author":"","url":"https://www.eidelmannlaw.ca/"},{"text":"Adam and his office provided excellent service, demonstrating professionalism and personal attention to all details in my defence, for several of my cases, which they won. Adam’s attitude towards the work he does not only won my cases, it also helped me to avoid other problems a potential client cannot foresee.","author":"","url":"https://www.eidelmannlaw.ca/"},{"text":"I have been a client of Maître Eidelmann''s for over 2 years now. I was in an impossible position. My previous attorney felt there was no hope and dismissed my troubles. When I entered M. Eidelmann''s office, I felt at ease almost immediately. He was attentive, compassionate, and understanding of my position and what my aim was.","author":"","url":"https://www.eidelmannlaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'eidelmann-law-inc-montreal' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
