UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I am grateful for the care and professionalism Daniel and Pat have shown me. Daniel has been exceptional. His legal expertise, calm guidance, and ethical approach have been evident from the beginning. He has handled my matter with professionalism, but also with genuine empathy and kindness, which has meant a great deal to me. Pat has also been wonderful.","author":"","url":"https://www.torontodivorcelaw.com/client-testimonials/"},{"text":"I just wanted to express my heartfelt thanks to you Simone! What felt like a frightening and impossible situation now feels like something I have finally made it thru. I guess the last 15 years....I really thought nothing could be done but that all has changed now.","author":"","url":"https://www.torontodivorcelaw.com/client-testimonials/"},{"text":"Retaining Lorne Fine was the best decision that I made during my divorce. He gave thoughtful consideration to matters, contemplating issues from various perspectives. When appropriate, Lorne generated alternatives, carefully appraising the potential benefits and risks of each strategy. His brilliant legal manoeuvres consistently resulted in positive outcomes.","author":"","url":"https://www.torontodivorcelaw.com/client-testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'fine-and-associates-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I''ve used Carter and his office for 2 real estate purchases, Incorporation and recently the development of shareholder agreements for a new venture. They are knowledgeable and trustworthy. Can''t ask for a better team supporting us. Kyle","author":"","url":"https://www.fortierlaw.com/"},{"text":"Have dealt with Carter on 8 separate real estate transactions. Very knowledgeable and I trust him 100%. Buying and selling a home could be very stressful but I never had to worry about the legal aspect.Carter always has your best interest in mind. Alex C","author":"","url":"https://www.fortierlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'fortier-law-firm' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"We are very grateful for the help we always receive from the lawyers Bilal, George, and Jaspaul. Since some years ago we have needed their services and as always the service exceeds our expectations. At any time we need them they are always available to help quickly and a high level of professionalism.","author":"","url":"https://www.forumlaw.ca/"},{"text":"This team is the best out there, and helped us work through a decades-old complexity that needed to get cleaned up. It was years in the making (matters like these take time), but I speak for a lot of people when I say that the team at Forum Law has been tremendous.","author":"","url":"https://www.forumlaw.ca/"},{"text":"I have worked with Allison Nutting for years (I believe around 2008)she had worked for McGee Richard and has recently moved to Forum Law and have continued to use her. Allison is amazing and I highly recommend using her. She has always won my cases in court ( resolving tenant vs landlord disputes).","author":"","url":"https://www.forumlaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'forum-law-llp-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Dear Ryan, Jen, Britney, Madison and Laura, We can not find words for what you guys have done for us, we could call on you guys in our darkest days. You always gave us hope that the worst was over and better days were ahead. We consider you our friends not our legal team.","author":"","url":"https://fosterslaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'fosters-law-llp-london' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"The child support calculator provided on line through this firm is awesome. We have a long standing support agreement and we use this annually to update the child support amounts based on our T4''s.Thank you for providing this great tool online which allows you lawyers to focus on cases that really require your help rather than simple accounting annually for…","author":"","url":"https://www.calgaryfamilylaw.ca/"},{"text":"Excellent support payment calculator!! Thank you for making something so hard, so easy online. It has taken me along time to ask for help after what I have been through.\" Spousal support calculator user","author":"","url":"https://www.calgaryfamilylaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'fraese-aymont-family-lawyers-calgary-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Mathais was great to work with! He listened to all my wishes, crafted a marriage agreement that required zero revisions , and took the time to explain all the legal speak so that I fully understood everything that went into the agreement. The entire process was quick, seamless, and easy.","author":"","url":"https://freedomfamilylaw.ca/"},{"text":"Mathais was excellent from start to finish. He took the time to understand my situation, explained everything clearly, and answered all my questions without ever making me feel rushed. He''s sharp, professional, and genuinely easy to work with. He made a stressful process feel manageable , and I always felt like I was in good hands. Highly recommend.","author":"","url":"https://freedomfamilylaw.ca/"},{"text":"I had an excellent experience with Freedom Family Law Firm, particularly working with my lawyer, Mathais Sarrazin, who assisted me with preparing my Prenuptial Agreement (Prenup). From start to finish, the entire process was seamless, convenient, and highly professional. Their online system was user-friendly, reliable, and very well-organized, making everything straightforward and stress-free.","author":"","url":"https://freedomfamilylaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'freedom-family-law' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"A few years ago I observed Mrs Mash Frouhar in action during a court trial. I was so impressed at how brilliant she is. I approached her for a business card just in case I needed a very good lawyer in the future. A few years later she got me out on bail.","author":"","url":"https://frouharlaw.com/"},{"text":"Connie D’Angelo of Frouhar Law did outstanding work counselling and representing me for my case. I couldn’t have found a better lawyer and firm. From the initial meeting all the way through to the final trial date Connie represented nothing but the highest degree professionalism.","author":"","url":"https://frouharlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'frouhar-law-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"He took a lot of weight off our shoulders by actively following up with immigration, guiding us and keeping us up to date throughout the case. I would highly recommend him to anyone going through the process.","author":"","url":"https://sponsorshipattorney.ca/"},{"text":"Nous tenons sincèrement à exprimer notre gratitude. Votre patience a été remarquable et vous avez pris le temps de nous guider à chaque étape de notre demande de parrainage. Merci infiniment.","author":"","url":"https://sponsorshipattorney.ca/"},{"text":"Très professionnel, à l''écoute et toujours disponible pour répondre à nos questions. Notre dossier de parrainage s''est conclu avec succès grâce à son expertise. Je recommande sans hésitation.","author":"","url":"https://sponsorshipattorney.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gad-pariente-montreal' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"When I bought the house next door to me 8 years ago my sister suggested I use Galbraith Law, as she used him when she had bought her house. They were excellent. They are well organized and do things on time. I subsequently… Read Full Review","author":"","url":"https://www.galbraith.ab.ca/"},{"text":"Just a note following your letter dated July 1. You’re so kind Stan to \u0003\"contribute\" to the resolution of what has become a nearly disastrously \u0003unhappy chapter in our lives… Read Full Review","author":"","url":"https://www.galbraith.ab.ca/"},{"text":"We have used Galbraith law over the past 25+ years. Service continues to be informed, helpful and understanding. Highly recommend","author":"","url":"https://www.galbraith.ab.ca/about-us/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'galbraith-law-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"We had an outstanding experience with Gail Law. The entire team was professional, supportive, and incredibly knowledgeable . A special thank you to Kim Gale, Palak, and Jessica each of you played a key role in making the process smooth and stress-free. Your clear communication, attention to detail, and dedication truly made a difference.","author":"","url":"https://galelaw.ca/"},{"text":"My wife and I have retained Kim and her team for four years and highly recommend the firm. A highlight: Kim and her team pursued a client of my wife that owed her $125,000 in fees. The client was living in Europe and very hard to find.","author":"","url":"https://galelaw.ca/"},{"text":"Incredibly grateful to everyone at Gale Law for assisting me with a small claims legal matter. Special thanks to Jessica as she worked with me specifically on my case. All interactions with her were very pleasant. Jessica responded to my emails quickly and answered my questions thoroughly.","author":"","url":"https://galelaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gale-law-professional-corporation-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"N.H. Client Reviews I’m so grateful for Ian, he truly cares about his clients. He’s as real as it gets. It’s nice to see a lawyer who’s passionate for the best outcome for his client. I can’t recommend this place enough!","author":"","url":"https://mineslaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"A.L. Client Reviews A huge thanks to Michael Mines for getting this criminal charge brought to a fair and appropriate conclusion with a criminal charge being dropped. Michael knows his profession and is well versed in criminal law to seek the best possible outcome for an individual like me, who at 77 years, simply made an honest mistake.","author":"","url":"https://mineslaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"I.A. Client Reviews Ian Gauthier helped me on my case recently, he is very knowledgeable and patient, provided me with wise advices with his professional expertise.He always answers me quickly and professionally with right guidance to move in positive direction.","author":"","url":"https://mineslaw.com/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gauthier-and-mines-criminal-lawyers-vancouver' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"J''ai reçu un service exceptionnel de la part de Me Gauthier et son équipe. Elle connaît très bien son sujet et est à l''écoute des besoins. Elle travaille vite et efficacement, je n''ai rien à reprocher. Son prix correspond à sa qualité de service. Je recommande fortement!","author":"","url":"https://avocatsgauthier.com/"},{"text":"Nous avons eu notre première consultation avec Maître Gauthier aujourd''hui même. Une avocate qui sait se qu''elle fait et où elle va. Des conseils judicieux et surtout un côté très humain et rassurant. Nous vivons une situation difficile et elle a su nous diriger afin d''avoir les meilleurs outils en cour. Merci encore ! On recommande.","author":"","url":"https://avocatsgauthier.com/"},{"text":"J''ai été très bien épaulée et conseillée tout au long du processus. Maître Gauthier a été humaine et à l''écoute.","author":"","url":"https://avocatsgauthier.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gauthier-avocats-brossard' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Evan Clemence supported our family through one of the most stressful and difficult periods of our lives, and it was an absolute blessing to have him as our lawyer. He made me and the kids feel safe and steady through the chaos of an incredibly stressful and complicated divorce.","author":"","url":"https://lisagelman.com/"},{"text":"Both Sierra and Rosalia were most helpful during our engagement and provided excellent customer service.","author":"","url":"https://lisagelman.com/"},{"text":"Julia Hockin was excellent to work with during a family law matter. She took over my file partway through, quickly got up to speed, and was organized, responsive, and thoughtful throughout the process. She took the time to explain my options clearly, answered my questions honestly, and respected my decisions, even when they differed from her recommendation.","author":"","url":"https://lisagelman.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gelman-and-associates' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I highly recommend George. He guided me through a complex family law case with strategic and practical advice. His expertise was instrumental in successfully resolving the matter and securing a positive, long-term outcome. If you need a professional who truly works with you as a team, George is the person to call.","author":"","url":"https://gleelaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"George Lee is a responsible, knowledgeable, and supportive family lawyer who genuinely cares about his clients. Throughout my case, he patiently explained the litigation process and guided me through family law while always encouraging me to focus on the best interests of my child and to remain a caring mother.","author":"","url":"https://gleelaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"I had a very positive experience working with George Lee and his team. George was professional and clear in his communication throughout the process. He explained my options and handled the matter with competence and care. His staff were also friendly and easy to communicate with, which made the process smoother.","author":"","url":"https://gleelaw.com/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'george-lee-law-corp-burnaby' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Offer with my first lawyer: $40,000. My case was settled for $476,095. Gertsoyg & Company are knowledgeable about law and determined to achieve results with the best interest of the client.","author":"","url":"https://www.yglaw.ca/testimonials/"},{"text":"A big thanks to you Yan and your team for a very good and attentive job. I will be recommending you, with great pleasure to my clients and friends.","author":"","url":"https://www.yglaw.ca/testimonials/"},{"text":"Perfect balance between being professional yet friendly and understanding. Very respectful and kind. I highly and have already recommended him to future clients.","author":"","url":"https://www.yglaw.ca/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'gertsoyg-and-company-burnaby' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I was impressed at how convenient and efficient the remote signing service offered by Giardino Law was. The video call with the lawyer made me feel confident and reassured throughout the process. I highly recommend their services to anyone looking for a stress-free real estate closing.","author":"","url":"https://myedmontonlawyer.com/"},{"text":"I was still living in Ontario when I bought my property in Edmonton and so I could not go to the lawyer''s office for signing. That''s when I discovered the remote signing service provided by Giardino Law. The lawyer guided me through the process via video call, and I returned the signed documents hassle-free.","author":"","url":"https://myedmontonlawyer.com/"},{"text":"I can''t thank Giardino Law enough for their remote signing service. It was incredibly convenient. The lawyer was professional, patient, and provided excellent guidance throughout the video call. I highly recommend their services to anyone looking for a modern and efficient way to close a real estate deal.","author":"","url":"https://myedmontonlawyer.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'giardino-law-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"After visiting other firms, I can confirm that they are extraordinary lawyers and amazing people. They take their time to listen to you, to understand as well as respect what your wants and needs.","author":"","url":"https://ginzburglegal.com/"},{"text":"As a first time “offender”, the initial weight on my shoulders was quite stressful; that is until I reached out to Adam. He’s a genuine and highly skilled lawyer that you’ll be thankful to have in your corner.","author":"","url":"https://ginzburglegal.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'ginzburg-legal-montreal' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Special commendation to Larissa she worked with me right from start to beginning wonderful to work with this place i would recommend","author":"","url":"https://glassgavellaw.com/"},{"text":"My firm relies on Larissa Kushwara and Glass Gavel Professional Corporation for many matters within the paralegal scope of practice including but not limited to representing clients before the landlord and tenant board, enforcement of landlord and tenant board orders, and appearances before the small claims court.","author":"","url":"https://glassgavellaw.com/"},{"text":"I recently had Larissa help me with an LTB hearing. She was very thorough with her research, her explanation of how things would go and at the end of everything, she helped me WIN and saved me from an eviction order that should never have been brought forward in the first place. I would highly recommend her.","author":"","url":"https://glassgavellaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'glass-gavel-professional-corporation-barrie' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
