UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Exceeded my Expectations. I can safely say the lawyers at HSP Law exceeded my expectations. They were friendly, hard working, and extremely knowledgeable. They were very honest with me at every turn. Highly Recommend. AW","author":"","url":"https://www.hsplaw.ca/"},{"text":"Amazing Results! HSP Law took my case and I couldn’t have been more pleased with the results. It was a fantastic experience and if I ever find myself needing legal expertise in the future, I’m definitely going straight to them. Couldn’t recommend them more! JS","author":"","url":"https://www.hsplaw.ca/"},{"text":"GREAT TO WORK WITH The Lawyers at HSP Law were great to work with. They helped me through my claim with professionalism and kindness. Would recommend for sure! MC","author":"","url":"https://www.hsplaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'hsp-law-north-york' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Thank you lawyer Derrick Hwang and legal assistant Krissy Frandsen for helping the sale of our home… It’s a quick closing date within 10 business days but they did not miss a beat on the whole process. We are truly impressed!!!","author":"","url":"https://www.edmontonlaw.ca/"},{"text":"As a realtor, I have been referring my clients to Greg Miskie for a while now but I personally just used him for the closing of our new home. Everything went very smooth thanks to Greg and his legal assistant, Alyssa.","author":"","url":"https://www.edmontonlaw.ca/"},{"text":"Terrific lawyers – very knowledgeable and personable. They consistently went the extra mile for me and were very pleasant about it. I received great advice which helped me solve my legal problem and even when we had to sign paperwork twice, it wasn’t a problem. I received copies and a final statement quickly. I wouldn’t hesitate recommending them!","author":"","url":"https://www.edmontonlaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'htm-law-llp-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Lai-King Hum is our strategic partner. We help patients and doctors maximize health outcomes. Today we have a company of over 120 employees and associates. With growth as a startup came challenges. Lai-King Hum provides strategic business guidance. We understand health and technology. Lai helps us understand the impact law and policy on the future of our business.","author":"","url":"https://thehumlawfirm.ca/"},{"text":"As a national firm with 30 offices and 300 employees, Financial Horizons Group has complex Employment Law requirements. We rely on the Hum Law Firm for all our Employment Law needs. Lai-King Hum (who we worked with when she was at McMillian LLP) provides Bay Street expertise, exceptional levels of service without the cost of Big Law overhead.","author":"","url":"https://thehumlawfirm.ca/"},{"text":"Working with the Hum Law Firm for the past year has been critical to our rapid growth and success in Canada. Lai is always quick to respond, providing guidance and support to promote positive employee relations – she is ‘au courant’ with employment case law sharing best practices and legislation at every opportunity.","author":"","url":"https://thehumlawfirm.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'hum-employment-law-firm-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Hi Team, I just wanted to take the time to send you a brief note of thanks in connection with the preparation of my Will, POA…etc.","author":"","url":"https://www.hummingbirdlaw.com/"},{"text":"George and Julie from Hummingbird Lawyers LLP offered a professional, compassionate and quick resolution to my effortless family situation. I am content with their outstanding response and seemingless solution for a flawless execution. I would most definitely reach out and/or use them in the future if needed. Highly recommend. Mark Mazzuca","author":"","url":"https://www.hummingbirdlaw.com/"},{"text":"I am client of Hummingbird company for many years.They provide very good service Very easy to communicate Always suggest the best solution Highly recommend!!!","author":"","url":"https://www.hummingbirdlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'hummingbird-lawyers-llp-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Getting my work permit through the LMIA process wasnât easy â it took time, patience, and a lot of effort. But thanks to the amazing support from Ms. Olga and my case manager, everything went much smoother than I expected.","author":"","url":"https://www.innakogan.com/"},{"text":"My family and I have been working with this office for over five years, and we have always received highly professional and reliable support. I would like to highlight the excellent and well-coordinated work of all the staff: their competence, attention to detail, and confident handling of every case. This year my sister received her permanent residency.","author":"","url":"https://www.innakogan.com/"},{"text":"I recently received my permanent residency, and Iâm very grateful for the professional and efficient support provided by this office. The team was reliable, knowledgeable, and easy to work with. Highly recommended.","author":"","url":"https://www.innakogan.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'inna-kogan-law-office-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Very satisfied with my experience working with Mr. Iqbal so far. He is knowledgeable, diligent, responsive and keeps my best interest at heart. I feel protected and well represented. Very grateful","author":"","url":"https://www.iqbalslaw.com/"},{"text":"I couldn''t recommend Mr. Iqbal more to anyone going through this difficult process. He is fair, honest, and takes the time to explain things in a very concise, calm manner. He cares and is only out for his clients best interests.","author":"","url":"https://www.iqbalslaw.com/"},{"text":"Mr. Iqbal recently represented my son in a long and arduous child custody case that went so far as trial. The outcome of the trial is that my son is now one of a very few fathers in Canada to be granted primary caregiver and sole decision-making status for his child. Mr.","author":"","url":"https://www.iqbalslaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'iqbal-law-professional-corporation-mississauga' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I was charged with 8 firearm and robbery related offences which was a very stressful and turbulent time for my family and I. Hiring Jag gave us a peace of mind that lasted the full 4.5 years I was in that situation. His expertise in the courtroom, extensive knowledge of the law and fearlessness led to all my charges stayed.","author":"","url":"https://jagvirklawyers.com/"},{"text":"If you need a lawyer who will go above and beyond to fight for you, look no further!! I cannot express how grateful I am for the outstanding work of Mr. Virk in handling what seemed like a hopeless DUI case.","author":"","url":"https://jagvirklawyers.com/"},{"text":"Jag virk is a great criminal lawyer. I would highly recommended that he is hard working, intelligent and strategic lawyer with a great reputation amongst judges, crowns and other defence lawyers, you wouldn’t find better. ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐","author":"","url":"https://jagvirklawyers.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'jag-virk-lawyers-hamilton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had a great experience working with Jahanshahi Business Law Firm during the purchase of my café. Mr. Jahanshahi was knowledgeable and thorough, and Assistant Alexcia was incredibly responsive and helpful throughout the process. Together, they made everything smooth and stress-free — from reviewing the deal to finalizing the purchase. I really appreciated their professionalism and support.","author":"","url":"https://jahanlaw.ca/"},{"text":"I am continually impressed by the professionalism, attention to detail, and level of care that I have the privilege to receive from the Jahanshahi Law Firm. I know my business''s legal interests are protected and in good hands.","author":"","url":"https://jahanlaw.ca/"},{"text":"Shah and his team have always been such a pleasure to work with. They''ve turned what are usually daunting legal tasks into a smooth and even enjoyable part of running a business.","author":"","url":"https://jahanlaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'jahanshahi-business-law-firm-north-york' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"An outstanding law firm! Everyone I had the pleasure of dealing with was personable, friendly, knowledgeable, and exceptionally efficient. James is an extremely sharp and capable lawyer who makes you feel comfortable and is always easy to talk to. Nicole is a fantastic law clerk, professional, accommodating, and an absolute pleasure to work with.","author":"","url":"https://jamesdeep.com/"},{"text":"Had an exceptional experience dealing with James Deep and his team while drafting up our Wills. Would strongly recommend them to anyone!","author":"","url":"https://jamesdeep.com/"},{"text":"James helped me with my own home purchase and has also guided several of my clients through their home closings. He has been fantastic every time—professional, knowledgeable, and always willing to answer questions. I highly recommend James to anyone looking for a reliable real estate lawyer!","author":"","url":"https://jamesdeep.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'james-deep-law-professional-corporation' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Ahmed Elsafadi was safe and on point! I was surprised at how I felt reassured through the whole thing and I know he is a busy guy. Thanks!","author":"","url":"https://jarrahlaw.com/"},{"text":"Janan Jarrah is incredibly knowledgeable and an excellent communicator. She has a clear and practical way of explaining family law that makes complicated situations much easier to understand. Even a consultation with her can provide tremendous clarity and direction for people experiencing difficult family matters.","author":"","url":"https://jarrahlaw.com/"},{"text":"I had a one hour consultation with Janan Jarrah, and I honestly learned so much from her in such a short time. She was incredibly compassionate, extremely knowledgeable, and gave me valuable feedback and guidance for my case. I’ve had a couple of other lawyers in the past, and I truly wish I had found her from the very beginning.","author":"","url":"https://jarrahlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'jarrah-law-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I look forward to working with you again. Thank you for everything you have already done for me.","author":"Amanda S.","url":"https://www.jklawoffice.ca/"},{"text":"Client Success Stories I hired Jide of Jklaw for my real estate transaction. He was always readily available whenever I needed to speak with him and he provided me with good counsel during the entire process. I would definitely recommend him to anyone seeking a lawyer for their real estate closing. – Datafad H.","author":"","url":"https://www.jklawoffice.ca/"},{"text":"I hired Jide of Jklaw for my real estate transaction. He was always readily available whenever I needed to speak with him and he provided me with good counsel during the entire process. I would definitely recommend him to anyone seeking a lawyer for their real estate closing. – Datafad H.","author":"Ola O.","url":"https://www.jklawoffice.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'jk-law-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Jasdeep Kaur is a wonderful person at heart talks with empathy, understands the clients emotions, gives time and genuinely puts efforts to help her clients through. She is approachable any time of the day. She willing to help and gives right information. I sincerely recommend her service and professionalism with excellent work ethic.","author":"","url":"https://jklawcorp.ca/"},{"text":"First and foremost kudos to Jasdeep. She handled my divorce case so very well and made things easy for me in that tough situation I was going through. Everything she made possible for me and handled with brilliance and with full ownership.","author":"","url":"https://jklawcorp.ca/"},{"text":"I highly recommend Jasdeep Kaur. She is extremely professional and guided my family and me through the immigration process step by step. She responded to our questions in a timely manner, and thanks to her help, we successfully became permanent residents.","author":"","url":"https://jklawcorp.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'jk-law-corporation-surrey' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had a very positive experience with Joe. After I was terminated from my employment, I was devastated. I did not know what to do and felt overwhelmed. Joe was compassionate and he advised me on what I was entitled to at law and walked me through the legal process in a clear and easy to understand way.","author":"A.K.","url":"https://jsblaw.ca/"},{"text":"Joe was caring and compassionate about me and my case. He took the time to listen and understand. He really cared for the outcome and for me as a person. He is knowledgeable and you can tell he is passionate about his work. My former employer was difficult, but Joe still ended up getting a good result for me.","author":"D.R.","url":"https://jsblaw.ca/"},{"text":"I was an employee and shareholder on the outs with management. I consulted Joe, who was able to get me a great severance package and a reasonable offer for the sale of my shares to my former partners. I without a doubt highly recommend Joe.","author":"G.R.","url":"https://jsblaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'jsb-calgary-employment-law-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Our Law Firm is client-focused and results-driven. Our Law Firm consists of experienced professionals with proven records of success. JSM Law will protect your interests. We offer competitive contingency fee structures.","author":"","url":"https://www.jsmlaw.ca/"},{"text":"I just finished my personal injury claim with Jujhar and his team at JSM Law. This firm was fantastic. They kept me posted with all the procedures and really took into consideration my needs. I had used another law firm previously that turned out to be a disaster, so I switched to JSM Law.","author":"Sue M.","url":"https://www.jsmlaw.ca/"},{"text":"I have had 2 cases handled by JSM Law, both outcomes were better than expected. Jujhar Mangat leads a very knowledgeable team. Every staff member served me very professionally and took a personal approach when in contact with me. My requests were handled diligently. I was kept in the loop all along.","author":"Crystal A.","url":"https://www.jsmlaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'jsm-law-mississauga' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"We found Justin to be extremely knowledgable, patient and focused when dealing with any questions we brought to him - and we threw some curveballs!","author":"","url":"https://jtcprofcorp.com/"},{"text":"Meeting Justin was a pleasant surprise, he''s extremely resourceful with a genuine interest in wanting to help small business owners manoeuvre their start ups. Not to mention he is very responsive and provides valuable business consultation and referrals immediately! He''s definitely someone I can count on and am looking forward to working with him.","author":"","url":"https://jtcprofcorp.com/"},{"text":"Justin was very professional and got back to my request right away. He shared knowledge and helped me out a ton. He would definitely be someone I would hire if need be.","author":"","url":"https://jtcprofcorp.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'justin-t-chan-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"As a real estate agent KS law firm is a law firm that I will always recommend to all my clients. They provide an excellent customer service and my clients thank me for referring them to KS lawyers.","author":"","url":"https://www.kslawyers.ca/"},{"text":"We are extremely happy with the services provided by KS Lawyers. The closing process went smoothly, thanks in large part to their diligent preparation and organization. They made sure that all paperwork was in order and that there were no last-minute surprises. I felt supported and informed throughout the entire process.","author":"","url":"https://www.kslawyers.ca/"},{"text":"KS Lawyers is absolutely fantastic practice with extremely personable staff! A friend recommended them to me and I''m glad she did!. All the staff were extremely professional and easy to work with.They really know their stuff and got our work done in the most professional and timely manner. Suman Sohi","author":"","url":"https://www.kslawyers.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'k-s-lawyers-surrey' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I called for legal advise and they got back to me quite promptly. I would also like to say they were professional and answered my questions clearly and respectfully. Thank you to Jeff for your help.","author":"Lori H.","url":"https://kahanelaw.com/"},{"text":"I can''t say enough about how easy and smooth Kahane Law made our real estate purchase and sale. Anne Hill kept us completely up to speed about every step in the process. Her responses to our questions were quick and very helpful.","author":"Lindsey S.","url":"https://kahanelaw.com/"},{"text":"Had a superb experience here. I felt like an important client even though my situation was really quiet mundane. The lawyer I spoke to (Brandy) was knowledgeable and was very easy to deal with. Jo was friendly and made me feel at ease. They both went out of their way to reschedule my appointment last minute to accommodate a surgery.","author":"Kelly P.","url":"https://kahanelaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'kahane-law-office-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I am incredibly grateful for the outstanding service I received from this law firm. From the very beginning, Mr. Kahlon was attentive, professional, and genuinely committed to my case. He took the time to listen, kept me informed throughout the entire process, and made sure I understood every step along the way.","author":"","url":"https://kahlonlaw.com/"},{"text":"Highly recommend Kahlon he is honest, professional, and supportive throughout our case. They worked diligently to help my husband obtain bail and always kept us informed. We are very grateful for their hard work and dedication.","author":"","url":"https://kahlonlaw.com/"},{"text":"I recently had the privilege to work with Mr. Kahlon and he absolutely lives up to his reputation. He handled my case professionally and tirelessly over several months; eventually resulting in a hard fought win at trial! Antar is very patient and goes above and beyond for his clients. If you need representation, look no further! Edit..","author":"","url":"https://kahlonlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'kahlon-law-mississauga' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Had a really good experience with Kainth Law Office. The team was friendly, professional, and always took the time to explain things clearly. The whole process felt smooth and straightforward, and I really appreciated how responsive and helpful they were. Definitely recommend them.","author":"Muhammad K.","url":"https://klawgp.com/"},{"text":"I had a very positive experience with Kainth Law Group. Sawyer was professional, responsive, and helpful throughout my matter. I felt well-informed throughout the process and appreciated the time taken to answer my questions and explain my options. I would highly recommend Kainth Law Group to anyone looking for legal assistance.","author":"Maria A.","url":"https://klawgp.com/"},{"text":"We want to express our deepest gratitude to Parth, Rebecca, and the entire team for their exceptional help in completing our first home purchase. Their seamless and professional handling of the transaction made the entire process incredibly smooth.","author":"Vigneshwaran M.","url":"https://klawgp.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'kainth-law-group-kitchener' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"created by save our planet I purchased a pre biult home from as it turned out, a very corrupt biulder who decided he wanted to charge us more money than what we agreed upon and not honor our signed purchase agreement, so we decided to hire Kamalie Law.","author":"","url":"https://kamalielaw.ca/"},{"text":"soraya alin Mr. Kamali was very helpful in providing me with legal advice and services. He is a skilled and caring lawyer.","author":"","url":"https://kamalielaw.ca/"},{"text":"Rhia Dhindsa I’ve had a positive experience working with Kamalie Law. Shayan and Karan are great litigators who are knowledgeable, professional, and efficient. I would definetly recommended Kamalie Law to anyone in need of legal services","author":"","url":"https://kamalielaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'kamalie-law-north-york' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
