UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I highly recommend Salma EL-Khodari. She successfully won my PRRA case in Winnipeg. She is professional, dedicated, and truly committed to her clients. I am extremely grateful for her hard work and support. Thank you, Salma!","author":"","url":"https://mcintoshzayed.ca/"},{"text":"Thank you for your professionalism, Mr. McLntosh & Zayed, your attentiveness, and your determination. Your work made all the difference… *Behind every great lawyer, there is knowledge, strategy, and above all, a genuine commitment to their client.","author":"","url":"https://mcintoshzayed.ca/"},{"text":"PHILIP AND ODAY Thank you so much for being my counsel representatives and, most importantly, for your continuous guidance, support, patience, and understanding throughout this entire process. I truly appreciate the time and effort you have dedicated to my case and the reassurance you have given me whenever I felt uncertain or overwhelmed.","author":"","url":"https://mcintoshzayed.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mcintosh-and-zayed-s-r-l-winnipeg' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had such a smooth experience working with McLaren Bryan Law on the purchase of my first home. Chantal explained every detail clearly and made me feel confident throughout the process. I highly recommend her services for anyone looking for a reliable real estate lawyer.","author":"","url":"https://mclarenbryanlaw.com/"},{"text":"McLaren Bryan Law handled my immigration matter with care and professionalism. The process can be overwhelming, the lawyer guided me step by step and was always available to answer my questions. Thanks to her expertise, I am now happily settled in Canada.","author":"","url":"https://mclarenbryanlaw.com/"},{"text":"I reached out to McLaren Bryan Law for estate planning, and I was impressed by the compassion and clarity I received. Chantal made a difficult conversation easy to approach and ensured my family’s future is protected. Truly excellent service.","author":"","url":"https://mclarenbryanlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mclaren-bryan-law-professional-corporation-peterborough' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had an excellent experience working with my lawyer, Frank. From the very beginning, he was very professional, knowledgeable, and genuinely attentive to my situation. He took the time to clearly explain every step of the process, which made me feel confident and well-informed throughout. What stood out the most was his responsiveness and dedication.","author":"","url":"https://www.ottawa-attorneys.ca/"},{"text":"You are in good hands Greg Gilhooly was my lawyer he always took his time and called me back when I had questions, provided me with taxis to get to my appointments and even paid out of pocket for therapy that the insurance company wouldn’t cover so I could heal properly.","author":"","url":"https://www.ottawa-attorneys.ca/"},{"text":"I had a great experience working with Frank on my vehicle accident claim. Right from the beginning, he was upfront about what to expect and kept me updated throughout the process. I never felt like I was left in the dark or ignored. They were professional and efficient, and they got me the result I was looking for.","author":"","url":"https://www.ottawa-attorneys.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mcnally-gervan-lawyers-llp-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Positive: Professionalism , Quality When I was going through one of the most difficult times of my life, they helped me get past it by giving me great advice and assisted me with the best defense I could possibly have. I would highly recommend them if you are also going through a hard time. Bad Man Skill a year ago","author":"","url":"https://www.mdlawgroup.ca/practice-areas/disclosure-lawyer"},{"text":"Dan is an absolutely amazing lawyer! The staff and himself are fast to respond and bring their A-game when it comes to getting the defence and justice you deserve! Dan has not only helped myself but many others I know and I have yet to hear a complaint.","author":"","url":"https://www.mdlawgroup.ca/practice-areas/disclosure-lawyer"},{"text":"Thank you very much MD Law Group, specifically Amanda E and Dan M ! You both are absolutely amazing individuals. Very knowledgeable, friendly, professional and made this experience effortless on my part !","author":"","url":"https://www.mdlawgroup.ca/practice-areas/disclosure-lawyer"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'md-law-group-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Working with Mr. Mehrez for years has been exceptionally reassuring. He is highly engaging and supportive, demonstrating deep knowledge that extends well beyond Canada’s borders. We trust his judgment, he has successfully handled multiple matters for our family and is always the first person we return to for advice on any legal issue we face.","author":"","url":"https://mehrezlaw.com/"},{"text":"I’ve had the pleasure of working with Hazem on several legal matters and have always been impressed by his professionalism, integrity, and attention to detail. He takes the time to understand each case, communicates clearly, and offers thoughtful, practical advice. Hazem’s commitment to his clients and his calm, reassuring approach make him a trusted and reliable lawyer.","author":"","url":"https://mehrezlaw.com/"},{"text":"J’ai grandement apprécié les services reçus de Maître Hazem Mehrez au cours de cette dernière année. Il a su mettre ses connaissances, son expérience en m’ écoutant avec compréhension et empathie.","author":"","url":"https://mehrezlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mehrez-law-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"From day one Miryam and her team made me feel at ease and never any pressure. They always were there for me when I needed them. I can''t say enough about MG Law. They fight for you and make sure you are well cared for. They are very honest and respectful.","author":"","url":"https://mginjurylawyers.com/"},{"text":"I had a very good experience with MG Law. Kyle was very professional and helpful through the whole process. He really took an interest in our case and he did everything he could to help us! We were very happy with the whole experience. I highly recommend this firm.","author":"","url":"https://mginjurylawyers.com/"},{"text":"A high level of professionalism that works extremely hard to get you what you deserve. I am a satisfied customer after settling my MVA claim. I highly recommend Miryam and her team at MG Law. Thank you so much Miryam and Banan I appreciate everything you guys did for me :)","author":"","url":"https://mginjurylawyers.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mg-law-personal-injury-lawyers-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Wills & Estate Planning We carefully study your family/financial background and then curate a plan which is in your best interest. We, wills and estate lawyers near me , carry all resources to provide our clients with a well-drafted will to save them from any probate fees or taxes.","author":"","url":"https://www.mianlaw.ca/"},{"text":"Lease Agreement Our commercial & residential lease agreement Ontario lawyers for commercial property and residential property will make a detailed review of the landlord''s draft lease agreement to ensure that nothing is wrong.","author":"","url":"https://www.mianlaw.ca/"},{"text":"Zain Siddiqui I used Mian Hakeem as my Real Estate Lawyer, he was professional, courteous, and made the process as enjoyable as possible, which is important considering it can be a dry topic. Highly recommend you give him a call.","author":"","url":"https://www.mianlaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mian-hakeem-law-professional-corporation' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Michael was very professional from the beginning of my experience with him. Being 20 years old, this was a very stressful and scary experience for me, but Michael made the process a breeze! He was there 24/7 for any questions I had. Being a first timer, I was not sure where to go or what to do.","author":"","url":"https://www.michaeldyck.ca/testimonials"},{"text":"Dealing with Michael has been a pleasure. With all the stressors associated with a charge along with personal issues dealing with divorce and custody, Michael made this process as stress free for me as possible. He took the time to review all aspects and make me feel comfortable dealing with him.","author":"","url":"https://www.michaeldyck.ca/testimonials"},{"text":"Being arrested for a DUI is very stressful. Especially if it''s your first time (like me). And when you don''t know much about how the law works, it can make life seem impossible. With Michael however, that wasn''t the case. After meeting with him, the worry and uncertainty disappeared.","author":"","url":"https://www.michaeldyck.ca/testimonials"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'michael-dyck-criminal-law-winnipeg' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I have had the pleasure of having Cathryn Moore as my criminal lawyer for the past 5 ish years and have nothing but great things to say about Cathryn she has saved me from years in jail she has gone over and above her call of duty to treat me as a human not a criminal.","author":"","url":"https://www.criminallawyervancouver.com/?utm_source=organic&utm_medium=googlemap"},{"text":"I recently required counsel and found exactly what I needed here. Jasmin Singh is a lawyer with an empathetic ear and great intellect. She immediately gave me confidence that my matter would be quickly and fairly resolved. She was right. Thank you Jasmin.","author":"","url":"https://www.criminallawyervancouver.com/?utm_source=organic&utm_medium=googlemap"},{"text":"I had the pleasure of working with Julie, and I can''t highly recommend her enough. From our first consultation, it was clear that she was not only knowledgeable in the field but also genuinely dedicated to her clients. If you''re looking for a lawyer who is both skilled an compassionate, Julie Audette is the one you want on your side.","author":"","url":"https://www.criminallawyervancouver.com/?utm_source=organic&utm_medium=googlemap"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mickelson-whysall-moore-law-group' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"The team at Millars Lawyers demonstrated an unparalleled level of legal expertise. Their profound knowledge of the law and attention to detail left me feeling confident and assured that I was in the best hands. They navigated my case with precision, providing valuable insights and strategic advice every step of the way.","author":"","url":"https://millarslaw.com/"},{"text":"I had a wonderful experience working with Luke Reidy! I consulted him about a situation that didn’t feel right and he took action right away to ensure I was properly compensated. Luke truly cares and wants to seek justice for anyone treated unfairly. He is also extremely professional and knowledgeable. I’m forever grateful for his legal advice and guidance","author":"","url":"https://millarslaw.com/"},{"text":"I’ve recently just had a really hard life experience with a past relationship and Luke Riedy has helped set me free and prove my innocence he is truly a hard working man and my guardian angel.","author":"","url":"https://millarslaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'millars-lawyers-london-london' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Best legal services in calgary. Very honest and help with everything from buying to selling. kept the process very smooth from the start to finish. Communicated everything and kept us in loop. Would recommend them.","author":"","url":"https://millenniumlawchambers.com/"},{"text":"I can’t thank my lawyer and his colleague enough for the incredible work they did on my case. From the very beginning, they treated me with respect, listened carefully, and always made sure I understood what was happening throughout the process. My case took a long time to complete, but they stayed patient, professional, and committed the entire way.","author":"","url":"https://millenniumlawchambers.com/"},{"text":"I am truly thankful for the help and support I received from Mr. Menon at Millennium Law. From the very beginning, he treated me with patience, respect, and genuine care. He took the time to explain everything clearly and made sure I understood each step of the process. Mr.","author":"","url":"https://millenniumlawchambers.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'millennium-law-chambers-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had the pleasure of having Miller Immigration Law Firm help me with my spousal sponsorship and previous visa refusals. I was provided with honest, friendly and effective counsel. I will gladly recommend Halyna to anyone that requires an immigration lawyer. They are competent, genuine and truly caring.","author":"","url":"https://millerlawfirm.ca/"},{"text":"Halyna Miller is one of the best in the profession. She is helpful, kind and always available to sort out any questions. Halyna Miller and her team provide quick service and are attentive to details. I would definitely recommend them to anyone looking for immigration services.","author":"","url":"https://millerlawfirm.ca/"},{"text":"The first time I spoke to Halyna on the phone was when my son came to Canada as a visitor, and I had many questions at that time. She gave me helpful advice on what to do, and helped me understand the process. Knowing that we were in good hands, I decided to retain Halyna as our representative.","author":"","url":"https://millerlawfirm.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'miller-immigration-law-firm-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Lynsey was incredible when working on my case in Family Court. She was professional, direct and compassionate. I could not have asked for a better outcome. Although it was a long and challenging road she was there, with her amazing team, to help me through every step of the way.","author":"","url":"https://familylawyerab.com/"},{"text":"Daniel Wilson is an exceptional family lawyer, especially for high-conflict cases. I hired him for an urgent scheduling dispute, and he went above and beyond my expectations. He responds quickly, provides reassurance, and clearly knows the law inside and out. I felt supported throughout and confident in his guidance.","author":"","url":"https://familylawyerab.com/"},{"text":"Thu Libin was professional, kind, and incredibly helpful during a stressful time. With very short notice before our court date, she made time for a consultation and even appeared in court for us—without her, our case likely would have been delayed. Her knowledge, understanding, and professionalism made a big difference, and we’re so grateful for her support.","author":"","url":"https://familylawyerab.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mincher-koeman-law-chambers-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Non-Unionized Charity (Not-for-Profit) Organization \"I have just finished reviewing the final documentation on our HRTO file and I wanted to express my sincere thanks to you both for your representation and counsel during this procedure.","author":"","url":"https://www.minkenemploymentlawyers.com/"},{"text":"VPI Inc., Richmond Hill “Thank you for all your hard work and kind support to enable us to present a wonderful employer event. All the employers were engaged and enjoyed the presentation.…Ron Minken has been a very popular key note speaker.” - Mary Pat Nash, VPI Inc., Richmond Hill","author":"","url":"https://www.minkenemploymentlawyers.com/services/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'minken-employment-lawyers-markham' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"After speaking with several law firms, I decided to retain Ross Mirian and Mirian Law Firm, and it was one of the best decisions I made following my accident. From day one, Ross demonstrated an exceptional understanding of serious injury claims, accident benefits, income replacement benefits, medical and rehabilitation benefits, chronic pain claims, concussion injuries, and personal injury litigation.","author":"","url":"https://mirianlaw.com/"},{"text":"I cannot recommend Ross Mirian and Mirian Law Firm highly enough. After my accident, I was overwhelmed dealing with injuries, insurance adjusters, paperwork, and uncertainty about my future. From our very first meeting, Ross took the time to explain the process, answer all of my questions, and make sure I understood my rights.","author":"","url":"https://mirianlaw.com/"},{"text":"I''ve worked with Ross for a long time. He''s a great conscientious Lawyer who knows what he is doing. He is responsive and really cares about his clients.","author":"","url":"https://mirianlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mirian-law-firm-markham' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Mitch Engel is a very knowledgeable and experienced criminal attorney in Brampton who represented me professionally. I highly recommend him.","author":"","url":"https://www.mitchengellaw.ca/"},{"text":"AMAZING LAWYER . THANKS MITCH FOR TAKING CARE OF MY MATTER IN COURT . VERY GOOD EXPERIENCE HAVING MITCH AS MY DEFENCE LAWYER. I WAS WRONGLY ACCUSED AND MITCH GOT THE CHARGES WITHDRAWN . HIGHLY RECOMMEND HIM . HE IS VERY PROFESSIONAL, HIGHLY KNOWLEDGEABLE AND KEEP IT SMOOTH WITHOUT ANY HASSLE.","author":"","url":"https://www.mitchengellaw.ca/"},{"text":"I want to give a huge thanks to Mitch Engel. I am so happy I approached this Brampton criminal law firm because they looked at me along with everything going on in my case. They were behind me all the time. I knew I was not guilty and they were able to prove this to the DA.","author":"","url":"https://www.mitchengellaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mitch-engel-criminal-lawyer-brampton-brampton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had an excellent experience working with Ashley on my Canadian permanent residence application. She demonstrated a high level of professionalism, expertise, and attention to detail throughout the entire process. Communication was clear and timely, and her guidance was consistently reliable. I greatly appreciated her support and would highly recommend her to anyone seeking professional Canadian immigration services.","author":"","url":"https://vancouverlaw.ca/challenging-immigration-decisions/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mks-immigration-lawyers' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Mary is an exceptional lawyer. Many years ago, I was going through a very difficult divorce and child custody process. Mary provided the legal support, guidance, and strong representation I needed—especially during a time when I was emotionally and mentally overwhelmed. She was fast, efficient, and highly professional throughout the entire process.","author":"MM","url":"https://mmfamilyanddivorcelawyers.ca/"},{"text":"Mary is amazing! I had been dealing with another lawyer for 6 months trying to get my kids back and after meeting with her and discussing options, we were in court with a verdict in my favour within 2 months. Mary was extremely knowledgeable, positive and realistic throughout the entire process.","author":"","url":"https://mmfamilyanddivorcelawyers.ca/"},{"text":"My divorce with Mary went incredibly smoothly! She’s super competent and efficient, and she really cared about my personal story. I’m so happy to have found an attorney with her expertise and empathy! Thankful for MM Law.","author":"","url":"https://mmfamilyanddivorcelawyers.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'mm-family-and-divorce-lawyers-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Stephanie - Thank you, thank you, thank you so much for keeping an eye on me until the very last minute. You made my life so easy when it was only chaos, pain and sadness. Your very detailed guidance gave me the confidence of doing everything in the right way.","author":"","url":"https://modernfamilylaw.ca/"},{"text":"Dear Stephanie, Thank you for all your hard work on my separation process. Thank you for being there for me every step of the way, for your advice, for your dedication, for being my eye-opener and for way more. You’ve been a blessing for me during this tough time in my life. Sending you tons of hugs.","author":"","url":"https://modernfamilylaw.ca/"},{"text":"Stephanie: The resolution of my separation wouldn’t have been possible without your patience and guidance helping me through a very difficult time in my life. I made it! Thank you from the bottom of my heart. On to a fresh start... looking forward to new adventures. Best wishes. You are wonderful.","author":"","url":"https://modernfamilylaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'modern-family-law-llp-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Murphy assisted with our home closing. He took time to explain and guide us through the process. Through his expertise, we were able to save cost and took possession at the exact time we wanted. Thanks Murphy and looking forward to closing the next one with you!","author":"","url":"https://mophlegal.ca/"},{"text":"BB (Eazy_B) 2 weeks ago G ★★★★★ Great service! They handle our real estate files seamlessly.","author":"","url":"https://mophlegal.ca/"},{"text":"Wendy and Moph (Muftau) made my loan paperwork experience so much less stressful. Clear, kind, prompt- thorough and doesn’t overcharge for unnecessary work. Would absolutely go to the team again for loan paperwork or real estate 🏡 legal. …","author":"","url":"https://mophlegal.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'moph-legal-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"My experience with Andrew was outstanding. What should have been a rather open and close situation, by no fault of Andrews, became a drawn out mess. Through this, he continued to prove why he was the right choice in representation.","author":"","url":"https://ontariofamilylaw.ca/"},{"text":"This letter is to commend Rachel for her detailed and concise direction during my separation. Rachel’s advice was clear and detailed and I definitely felt protected navigating the separation process.","author":"","url":"https://ontariofamilylaw.ca/"},{"text":"When we went to our court dates Mr. Morrison handled himself in a professional manner. In my particular case his work quality was excellent and I obtained the outcome I wanted. If you are looking for a great divorce Lawyer, Mr. Morrison is someone you can trust to represent you with confidence.","author":"","url":"https://ontariofamilylaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'morrison-williams-llp-oakville' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I am so impressed with this legal team. Immediately the phone was picked up and I retained Hossein as a lawyer. Within 1 minute of hanging up, one of Hossein’s team members reached out and got the full story from me.","author":"","url":"https://motevallicriminallawyers.com/"},{"text":"I would like to Thank Mr.Motevalli Law group, for their hard work & dedication to my case , which was very complex, I was assured from the start when i retained him to represent my case I was in very good hands, Mr.Montevalli got my charges dropped within 4months.Mr.","author":"","url":"https://motevallicriminallawyers.com/"},{"text":"I’m incredibly grateful to my lawyer and his team for expertly handling my case and getting me out of this matter. Their professionalism, dedication, and support made a huge difference. I truly appreciate their hard work, his expertise and dedication were exceptional. A big thanks to his team as well for their consistent support and hard work.","author":"","url":"https://motevallicriminallawyers.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'motevalli-law-group-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Just want to thank you for handling my very delicate and impossible case. Who would ever think that after years of hiding and worrying my case will be approved and I would obtain Permanent Residency. -Anna & Ronald","author":"","url":"https://moyal.com/"},{"text":"Henry Moyal was extremely professional, and knowledgeable, and always went the extra mile to support me in my case to obtain permanent residence I highly recommend him to the Spanish community and anyone seeking immigration assistance in Toronto. Thank you Henry for your tremendous work and dedication in my case. Jose Alvarez","author":"","url":"https://moyal.com/"},{"text":"More than 5 stars. Henry gave us straight and achievable advice which we took, our bit complicated immigration case which he handled ended up in a swift and favourable result. Totally highly recommended. Tonie Jun Farrol","author":"","url":"https://moyal.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'moyal-immigration-lawyers-north-york' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Peter Tioco My family has known, relied and trusted Mr. Peter Crawford’s law firm Munro & Crawford for our legal needs ranging from corporate, real estate and family law for over forty (40) years. The service provided has consistently been personable, practical and professional. More importantly, the performance has constantly been prompt, proficient and productive. I would highly recommend Mr.","author":"","url":"https://munrocrawford.ca/testimonials/"},{"text":"George Battye, Chartered Accountant I have known Peter for many years and we have done a great deal of work together on clients who required complex [Canadian income tax structures] to achieve their goals, and others who needed our services to assist in divesting all or a part of their business, or to make an acquisition.","author":"","url":"https://munrocrawford.ca/testimonials/"},{"text":"Allen and Russet MacKay [Munro & Crawford] have advised us on so many things over the years both large and small. No matter the size of the problem [Munro & Crawford] were always there with calm and sensible advice. Resolving all manner of things – both business and personal.","author":"","url":"https://munrocrawford.ca/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'munro-and-crawford-vancouver' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I worked with Bill Dick on an ICBC case after a car accident and I would highly recommend him. He was kind, caring, and guided me through the entire process with patience and professionalism. He negotiated my injury settlement and I achieved very good results. I’m extremely happy with the outcome. Thank you, Bill, for all your support","author":"","url":"https://www.murphybattista.com/?utm_source=GMBlisting&utm_medium=organic"},{"text":"I was seeking representation for medical malpractice and feel fortunate to have been represented by Kevin Gourlay. Although my case was challenging, Kevin walked me through each step, relaying the pros and cons in an easy to understand manner. Kevin is not only an excellent lawyer but also compassionate and kind.","author":"","url":"https://www.murphybattista.com/?utm_source=GMBlisting&utm_medium=organic"},{"text":"I had a great experience working with Bill Dick and his team. They were incredibly knowledgeable, professional, and kind throughout the entire process. I wouldn’t hesitate to recommend Bill to anyone looking for legal help. Thank you for everything!","author":"","url":"https://www.murphybattista.com/?utm_source=GMBlisting&utm_medium=organic"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'murphy-battista-llp' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"After previously going to another immigration service it became glaringly obvious how great this service was. Angel was able to answer all my questions and share with me some options that I had not been told of by the other lawyer. I highly recommend this service. 5 out of 5 » Rating by: David Andrews B.","author":"","url":"https://www.myvisasource.com/"},{"text":"I absolutely love this firm. Very detailed and best help you can get. They do free consultation too which is great. Angel is amazing. Trevor is great. Best team at My Visa Source . I was happy with how my application was handled. 5 out of 5 » Rating by: Josh A.","author":"","url":"https://www.myvisasource.com/"},{"text":"This was a free consult call. I received the call exactly at the time arranged. Irfhan was very helpful, honest and informative. Unfortunately there weren’t many options for my case and he made no false promises. His integrity was impeccable and even though there wasn’t much that could be done he did offer some great suggestions and advice.","author":"","url":"https://www.myvisasource.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'my-visa-source-legal' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
