UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"This review is for Preszler Law Christopher McDougall and Craig McIvor I wanted to deeply thank the team and Christopher for their compassion. Although not every case can be successful depending on the details, the firm was thoughtful and they do know their clients by memory Thank you for the guidance and support during such a difficult time.","author":"D.D.","url":"https://www.preszlerlawbc.com/"},{"text":"I had an excellent experience working with Joseph and the entire team. They were professional, knowledgeable, and kept me informed every step of the way. Joseph was always responsive, took the time to answer my questions, and made a difficult process much easier to navigate.","author":"D.H.","url":"https://www.preszlerlawbc.com/"},{"text":"We were very pleased with Seth and his Assistants the way they handled Gerald’s Case. They were very patient and understanding and answered all our questions.We would highly recommend Seth from Preszler Injury Lawyers.","author":"S.B.","url":"https://www.preszlerlawbc.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'preszler-injury-lawyers' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I found Curtis Steeves’ work to be exceptional. He was direct, professional, and extremely responsive throughout my case. He was very effective in dealing with the Crown and always kept me focused on the facts and what truly mattered.","author":"","url":"https://www.pringlelaw.ca/"},{"text":"Pringle Law is top notch! Susannah Morrison is friendly, knowledgeable, quick and efficient. She achieved in less than a month something that I could not do on my own over the course of a year. She communicated with me every step of the way. I could not be happier with the service I received.","author":"","url":"https://www.pringlelaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'pringle-law-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"STRONGLY recommend you read this. THIS Is the ONLY Law firm I have found after around half a dozen consults in barrie that will speak WITH you. This is not your average law firm who is going through the motions and going to “tell you how this works” while they bill you hours.","author":"","url":"https://plslawyers.ca/"},{"text":"We highly recommend Evgeniy Osipov and the Progressive Legal Solutions (PLS) Team. Evgeniy demonstrated an exceptional knowledge and experience of the law and provided a strategic approach in representing our daughter. He showed great compassion and care for our daughter’s wellbeing and helped to navigate our daughter through the legal process.","author":"","url":"https://plslawyers.ca/"},{"text":"I was involved in a family law matter for over three years with very poor progress. The process was extremely stressful and financially draining. After deciding to change my legal team, I met Evgeniy and Kim, and from that moment everything changed for the better. From the very beginning, they were professional, knowledgeable, and incredibly supportive throughout my case.","author":"","url":"https://plslawyers.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'progressive-legal-solutions-barrie' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"In addition to being an experienced lawyer, Mr. Tonks has a wealth of knowledge and experience. Chris and Hailey, I appreciate all the time and effort you put into all of your suggestions. I would recommend you and your team to anyone seeking assistance and in need of their services.","author":"","url":"https://pdclawyers.ca/testimonials/"},{"text":"Mr. Tonks is absolutely fantastic. He takes his time to understand your needs and requirements and then he works his magic. The detail and effort he takes in his cases is unmatched. He was able to get us the result we wanted in less than a year.","author":"","url":"https://pdclawyers.ca/testimonials/"},{"text":"Mr. Chris Tonks is a very experienced and knowledgeable lawyer. Thank you Chris for all your efforts and time for resolving my case. I will ensure to recommend you and your team to all my friends and family who are looking for an amazing municipal lawyer.","author":"","url":"https://pdclawyers.ca/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'prouse-dash-crouch-llp-brampton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had a remarkable experience with PSB LAW OFFICE . They were professional, knowledgeable, and always responsive to my questions and concerns. Gurdev Singh Sekhon","author":"","url":"https://psblaw.ca/"},{"text":"Impressed with Mr. Raheel''s outstanding service. Despite a tight timeline and my absence, he handled the closing with utmost professionalism and efficiency. Affan Khalid","author":"","url":"https://psblaw.ca/"},{"text":"I wholeheartedly recommend Raheel Nazim for home purchase representation. A lawyer who goes above and beyond to protect your interests. Asim Khusro","author":"","url":"https://psblaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'psb-law-office-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I really enjoyed working with Raluca. I’ve worked with many different lawyers in different capacities and what stood out for me was Raluca’s care and attention to detail. She is extremely patient and will explain complexities and suggest the best path forward from her experience with other clients. Thank you so much Raluca!","author":"","url":"https://rms-law.ca/"},{"text":"Raluca and team assisted my family and I navigate through the process of losing our parents. From first interaction Raluca was quick to respond which was great, professional and looked over everything thoroughly.","author":"","url":"https://rms-law.ca/"},{"text":"We went to her at a very difficult time. I had just been diagnosed with Cancer. She was so friendly, accommodating and thoughtful. Yet professional and thorough. I would highly recommend her.","author":"","url":"https://rms-law.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'raluca-m-soica-barrister-and-solicitor-north-york' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Highly recommend Mr. Hameed. He is extremely supportive, patient, and knowledgeable. Always provided clear guidance every step of the way and went above and beyond to ensure a smooth process. Our entire family is grateful for his dedication and expertise to resolve our matter! ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️","author":"","url":"https://umerhameed.ca/"},{"text":"Professional, responsive, and knowledgeable. I was well informed throughout the process and felt confident with the outcome. Highly recommend.","author":"","url":"https://umerhameed.ca/"},{"text":"I am thankful to Mr. Umer as he provided us an exceptional service throughout out our whole matter. As he speaks fluent Punjabi and Hindi as well so communication was more easy.He is very nice and polite person.Thank you","author":"","url":"https://umerhameed.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'rana-u-hameed-criminal-law-mississauga' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I would like to sincerely thank Randy for his professionalism, intelligence, and kindness throughout the case he helped me with. From the very beginning, he was extremely helpful, attentive, and professional in the way he handled everything. I truly appreciated how prompt he was in responding to my questions and how clear and organized his communication always was.","author":"Riya C.","url":"https://www.mississaugacriminaldefencelawyers.com/"},{"text":"I am truly grateful for the support and guidance I received from Randy Norris. He handled my case with professionalism, clarity, and genuine care, which made a difficult time much easier to navigate. His consistent communication and thoughtful approach gave me confidence throughout the process. Thanks to his dedication, the matter was resolved successfully. I would highly recommend his services.","author":"Inam U.","url":"https://www.mississaugacriminaldefencelawyers.com/"},{"text":"Randy Norris, Cannot begin to describe his honesty and excellent work experience, fought my case and helped me through to clean the mess beyond my expectations. Again, much appreciated and extremely grateful to retain him as my Lawyer. Real definition of GREATEST Lawyer of Toronto !! Highly recommended Criminal defence Lawyer in GTA.","author":"","url":"https://www.mississaugacriminaldefencelawyers.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'randy-norris-mississauga' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"After being terminated from my job following a harassment complaint I made against another employee at work, I was devastated. I was dealing with not only my sudden job loss but depression and anxiety. Andrew Rebane kept everything in focus. He walked me through the process and explained in great detail what to expect. He made it easy and structure.","author":"","url":"https://www.resolutionslawcorp.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"I have used Andrew Rebane in many capacities as a lawyer since 1998. He has always served myself and my family well, being diligent, prompt and effective, while being empathetic to our causes and needs. In particular, he was swift in his actions when my daughter was wrongfully dismissed from her employment several years ago.","author":"","url":"https://www.resolutionslawcorp.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"I was a top producer at my workplace when a superior started bullying and harassing me. I was at a loss as to what to do until I con- sulted with Andrew Rebane who quickly assessed I was being victimized by a superior who wanted my book of business.","author":"","url":"https://www.resolutionslawcorp.com/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'resolutions-law-corporation' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"A huge thank you to Ryan and the team at RLC Law! They handled my home purchase flawlessly. What stood out most was their responsiveness; I never felt left in the dark. Ryan is knowledgeable, kind, and truly cares about his clients. I will definitely be recommending them to my family and friends","author":"","url":"https://www.rlclegal.ca/"},{"text":"I have had the pleasure of working with this Ryan on several transactions, and he has consistently been outstanding. He is professional, knowledgeable, and always kind and respectful to my clients, which truly makes a difference during what can be a stressful process.","author":"","url":"https://www.rlclegal.ca/"},{"text":"Ryan went above and beyond to help me with the closing of my house. It was a complicated deal with a tight timeline, over the holidays, and I was kept completely in the loop and getting responses well outside of business hours.","author":"","url":"https://www.rlclegal.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'rlc-law-north-york' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Positive: Professionalism My boyfriend and I had the pleasure of working with Rohan as the experience we received from him was amazing from start to finish. He was super understanding and helpful with our case and always kept us updated with what was happening.","author":"","url":"https://www.rohanhate.ca/"},{"text":"Rohan is extremely knowledgeable and experienced in his field of practice. Throughout the course of my interactions with Rohan, he was always very responsive and kept my best interest at the top. If you are looking for legal advice in Rohan''s domain of practice, I can confidently recommend to book a consultation with Rohan.","author":"","url":"https://www.rohanhate.ca/"},{"text":"Positive: Professionalism, Quality, Responsiveness, Value Working with Rohan has been a great experience from start to finish. He was extremely helpful and knowledgeable and was able to obtain the best possible outcome for me in my case. I would strongly recommend him to anyone seeking legal help or advice. Thank you, Rohan, for all of your great work!","author":"","url":"https://www.rohanhate.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'rohan-hate-litigation-lawyers-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
