UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"We love Sitka! They were so helpful and insightful when starting our business from the ground up. We''d highly recommend to anyone! ... they''re pretty good at spin too!","author":"","url":"https://sitkalaw.ca/testimonials/"},{"text":"I met Gurpreet through my Rotary club, so when I decided to sell my condo privately, I asked her to help with the legal aspects. She and her team turned what could have been a nerve wracking process in to an orderly one.","author":"","url":"https://sitkalaw.ca/testimonials/"},{"text":"We have dealt with Christian on a few real estate transactions and have been very impressed! He is extremely knowledgeable and efficient and a pleasure to deal with. Highly recommended!","author":"","url":"https://sitkalaw.ca/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'sitka-law-group-victoria' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Adam expertly guided us through the IRCC intricacies of applying for and obtaining Permanent Residence status. We were very pleased with his availability and expertise throughout the process. Highly recommended.","author":"","url":"https://slipacofflaw.com/"},{"text":"From the moment I first opened the door to Adam’s office six years ago, I knew I was in the right hands. Over six long years of hard work, he guided me every step of the way toward my citizenship with unparalleled dedication, deep knowledge, and respect.","author":"","url":"https://slipacofflaw.com/"},{"text":"I highly recommend using Adam for any immigration needs! He helped my wife get her Canadian PR. During the whole process he was formal, respectful and very helpful. Very cost effective as well. Overall extremely satisfied with his effort and all of the help he gave us!","author":"","url":"https://slipacofflaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'slipacoff-immigration-law-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Waheeda is highly knowledgeable in her field and I fully trusted her advice and guidance during the whole severance negotiation process with my former employer. She has excellent communication skills and always kept me updated on any new developments. I highly recommend Waheeda at Smith Employment Law.","author":"","url":"https://smithemploymentlaw.ca/"},{"text":"Ms. Smith was able to review my job offer and provide very helpful feedback. She was transparent about all aspects of the contract review and was able to provide valuable insight that helped me make a decision moving forward.","author":"","url":"https://smithemploymentlaw.ca/"},{"text":"Waheeda is very easy and friendly to approach. She provided me with lots of legal advices. I will definite go back to her if I need more consultation. Highly recommended.","author":"","url":"https://smithemploymentlaw.ca/about/client-testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'smith-employment-law-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"A commanding performance conducted by an artist in advocacy is a rare and precious item. In my 12 years of presiding over hundreds, maybe even close to a thousand proceedings on the bench, I have seen truly excellent advocacy on only a very few occasions. Mr.","author":"","url":"https://www.sil.lawyer/"},{"text":"The appeal process was next and was handled skillfully and was resolved without an appeal trial due to the diligence, tenacity and negotiating skills of Mike and Peter. I would and have recommended the Smitiuch Injury Law to anyone looking for a complete and professional injury law firm.","author":"Dave S.","url":"https://www.sil.lawyer/"},{"text":"Being injured is very stressful. Mike and his team treated me with respect, dignity and caring. I would get weekly calls to see how I was doing and was kept updated on my case. I was treated like family, not like a number.","author":"Dan P.","url":"https://www.sil.lawyer/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'smitiuch-injury-law-etobicoke' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I’m extremely thankful for helping me get my PR approval and my mom’s Super Visa. The entire process was handled with care and professionalism. They were always available to answer my concerns and kept me updated throughout. Their guidance made everything much easier for me. I highly recommend their services!","author":"","url":"https://snowdropimmigration.ca/"},{"text":"I had a great experience with Snowdrop Immigration. They worked on my PR, work permit, and my mother-in-law’s Super Visa application, and everything was handled very professionally. The team was patient, supportive, and always available to answer my questions. I’m very thankful for their help and would definitely recommend them to others.","author":"","url":"https://snowdropimmigration.ca/"},{"text":"I am so much happy that snowdrop immigration took care of my application and had it approved. Not only mine but my spouse also got PR. Thank you Simar sir for all the efforts you have put in my application. Anyone looking for applying any of your applications please contact snowdrop. Unlike other consultancies snowdrop do not charge so much.","author":"","url":"https://snowdropimmigration.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'snowdrop-immigration-services-ltd-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I feel truly lucky to have worked with Mr. Ali and Mr. George during one of the most difficult and complex legal cases I’ve faced. From the very beginning, I felt supported and knew I could truly trust them.","author":"Reza S.","url":"https://sodagar.ca/"},{"text":"Ali and his professional team have been supporting me with my businesses and real estate matters since 2015. They''ve consistently provided me with the best advice and top-notch service. If you''re looking for a highly professional lawyer, I strongly recommend Ali Sodagar.","author":"Milad S.","url":"https://sodagar.ca/"},{"text":"I had such a smooth experience with Sodagar &Co with a real estate transaction back in 2017 I have exclusively used them for all other real estate transactions since, including most recently in early 2024. The team is always organized, professional, and they catch the mistakes others make.","author":"Natalie A.","url":"https://sodagar.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'sodagar-and-company-law-corporation-vancouver' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Stacey helped me with my case with my previous employer. He worked incredibly hard on my case and helped me fight the wrongful dismissal, eventually settling at a very good deal. I was impressed by his professionalism and integrity.","author":"Beijia Z.","url":"https://www.wrongfuldismissal.ca/"},{"text":"Stacey and his team did a fantastic job with my case. Their professionalism and many years of experience helped me settle. I would highly recommend seeking advice before signing any documents.","author":"R C.","url":"https://www.wrongfuldismissal.ca/"},{"text":"Stacey Ball fought hard in my wrongful dismissal case and we came out ahead. I am very happy with him and his team and strongly recommend him.","author":"Marion G.","url":"https://www.wrongfuldismissal.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'stacey-r-ball-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I had a positive experience working with Simran Sandhu. She was professional, knowledgeable, and approachable throughout the process. I appreciated her guidance, clear communication, and willingness to address my questions. Navigating legal matters can be stressful, and having someone who takes the time to explain the process makes a real difference.","author":"","url":"https://sternshapraylaw.ca/"},{"text":"Simran was so nice and understanding of my situation she helped me and handled everything so well couldn’t have asked for a better lawyer :) Thank you","author":"","url":"https://sternshapraylaw.ca/"},{"text":"I could not be more pleased with how Simran has helped me with my lengthy court case! Back in 2024 I was caught up in a criminal charge along with hybrid traffic violations. I was potentially looking at 18months prison time. She was able to get me a conditional discharge from the judge with probation.","author":"","url":"https://sternshapraylaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'stern-shapray-criminal-lawyers-surrey' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Martha and her team were such a pleasure to work with. They made the overwhelming and stressful process of moving much more easy to navigate. They were in touch frequently with a checklist of things they required. They met with us a few days before moving to break down everything and they made us feel very comfortable and confident. AP","author":"","url":"https://www.sullivanlawptbo.ca/"},{"text":"Prompt, professional, always available and took much of the worry out of selling and buying a home. I would recommend the services of Sullivan Law \"hands down\". KS","author":"","url":"https://www.sullivanlawptbo.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'sullivan-law-ptbo' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"We had a great experience working with Gabrielle and Cassandra at Summit Legal Group for our home purchase. They made the whole process easy to understand by taking the time to explain everything and answering all of our questions. Closing day went exactly as planned with no hiccups, and everything was completed on time, which made the experience completely stress-free.","author":"","url":"https://summitlegalgroup.ca/"},{"text":"Excellent Service From Warren Woo today with my estate planning documents. I highly recommend Warren or any of the Summit Legal team for you needs.","author":"","url":"https://summitlegalgroup.ca/"},{"text":"Warren was excellent. He explained everything clearly, answered all of our questions, and made the entire process easy to understand. We really appreciated his professionalism, knowledge, and patience. I would highly recommend him & Summit to anyone looking for a great real estate lawyer.","author":"","url":"https://summitlegalgroup.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'summit-legal-group-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"After years of feeling completely defeated and discouraged with the family court system I retained Jagriti Jaswal and finally feel like I really have someone in my corner. Thanks to Jagriti I''m FINALLY seeing progress which is absolutely life changing for my young son and I. We can''t thank you enough!","author":"","url":"https://www.surroviklawcorporation.ca/"},{"text":"Jagriti has been a great asset for the kids and I and protecting us! I highly recommend her. She is very punctual.","author":"","url":"https://www.surroviklawcorporation.ca/"},{"text":"Ms. Jagriti is very good. She never left me and she really fought for my rights until I got what was right for me and for my children. inside the court she is the professional and outside the court room she will consider you a friend not a client. So thankful to have her.","author":"","url":"https://www.surroviklawcorporation.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'surrovik-law-corporation-surrey' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I am so glad I chose Susan Karpa as my criminal defence lawyer! I have never been on the other side of the law before. It was very difficult but she was very empathetic and compassionate, she always had my back. Her expertise, attention to detail, and dedication to me and my case gave me confidence.","author":"","url":"https://www.susankarpa.com/"},{"text":"I highly recommend Susan To anyone who needs help in a difficult situation. She was extremely knowledgeable, had clear direction and a plan, and persevered to get the results that I needed. My charges were withdrawn which allowed me to get back to my work and life .","author":"","url":"https://www.susankarpa.com/"},{"text":"Best decision I made. Fellow legal professional here. Susan handled my matter with precision, and the charge was withdrawn. She was clear about her demanding expectations — but if you''re willing and able to do what she says, her results are outstanding. She was responsive, strategic, and transparent about costs from day one.","author":"","url":"https://www.susankarpa.com/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'susan-karpa-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"John Nelson’s legal council was essential in winning my case. His assistance was unfaltering and sincere. Subsequent aid with any legal matter is always quickly and efficiently provided. I highly recommend him as legal council.","author":"","url":"https://www.swiftsurelaw.ca/"},{"text":"I have been assisted by John Nelson for years. Family court is the worst place on earth, and I wanted The assistance of someone who is knowledgeable and fierce. John is it","author":"","url":"https://www.swiftsurelaw.ca/"},{"text":"I cannot recommend Swiftsure law highly enough. From the moment I walked through their doors Danielle’s presence felt like a warm hug. They helped me navigate my lawsuit with dignity and support. I loved working with them and will be back with any additional needs that may arise. I have actively recommended them to my friends and family.","author":"","url":"https://www.swiftsurelaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'swiftsure-law-victoria' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"With former experience representing major insurance companies in defending personal injury claims, I now only represent Plaintiffs. I know how to deal with insurance companies to get you the best settlement possible.","author":"","url":"https://szakacslaw.ca/"},{"text":"To my legal advisor Mr. Dale Szakacs and staff, I''m very very pleased with my experience with the Szakacs Law Firm. My Lawyer Mr. Dale Szakacs has been very attentive and thorough in his communication with me throughout the entire legal process.","author":"","url":"https://szakacslaw.ca/"},{"text":"I can highly recommend Dale and his legal team. Dale dealt with my personal injury claim in a very professional, efficient, thorough and timely manner. He was at all times happy to answer any questions or queries I had and kept me informed of the status and progress of my claim.","author":"","url":"https://szakacslaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'szakacs-law-injury-lawyers-calgary-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"how can we Help you? Let''s start the conversation Get legal help with compassion and care! First Name Last name Email Address Telephone Number Service Area Select one... Wills / Estate Planning Probate / Estate Management Real Estate Divorce & Separation Services Marriage Contracts, Prenuptial & Cohabitation Agreements Other How Can We Help You?","author":"","url":"https://www.tabuchilaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'tabuchi-law-mississauga' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I live in Whitehorse, Yukon, where I work as a truck driver. My livelihood was at risk when I was charged with impaired driving and faced the devastating reality that I may lose my license for at least a year. Luckily, I was referred to David Tarnow by a friend who had used his services in Vancouver.","author":"","url":"https://www.tarnowcriminallaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"I was at a dinner party at a friend’s house, had a few glasses of wine, and made the poor decision of driving home — and was stopped by police just around the corner from where I live. I blew over the legal limit and was charged with a DUI.","author":"","url":"https://www.tarnowcriminallaw.com/testimonials/"},{"text":"After speaking with a few lawyers regarding the appeal of my 90-day Immediate Roadside Prohibition (IRP), I felt most comfortable with Jason.","author":"","url":"https://www.tarnowcriminallaw.com/testimonials/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'tarnow-criminal-law-richmond' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Our recent purchase was complicated due to a quick possession date and without Sunny, I am certain we would have missed deadlines and been charged penalties. Sunny did everything possible to ensure that things got done on time. He stayed on top of the process and coordinated all the required paperwork. He is dedicated and a great communicator.","author":"Sean N.","url":"https://tathgarlaw.com/"},{"text":"It has been a pleasure to get Sunny''s guidance in our recent real estate transaction. Recognizing that legal dealings can be complex and daunting, we really appreciated his accessibility, responsiveness, and clear communication throughout the process. We look forward to working with you again in the future, Sunny!","author":"Lara M.","url":"https://tathgarlaw.com/"},{"text":"Sunny is a extremely knowledgeable and personable lawyer. He was able to help with all real estate/HoldCo/trust questions I had and break down the benefits and estates/tax considerations for each.","author":"Deepak N.","url":"https://tathgarlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'tathgar-law' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
