UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Truly a caring and compassionate law firm to deal with, They dont blur the lines of whats immoral Nor do they sugar coat the situations at hand. If you are looking for a law firm that has YOUR best interests at heart then i couldn''t honestly recommend this law firm more!","author":"","url":"https://victorialaw.ca/"},{"text":"VPC was recommended via word of mouth from a few family friends as a go to for all things legal in Vic/SSI. We were very fortunate to find Mr. Clausen to help set up and execute a very charged family estate issue. I could not be happier with the outcome. Mr. Clausen was amazing from the beginning.","author":"","url":"https://victorialaw.ca/"},{"text":"I worked with Gregory Rhone on a recent purchase transaction and was thoroughly impressed. A fantastic communicator throughout the process — responsive, clear, and always one step ahead. He truly goes above and beyond for his clients, ensuring every detail is looked after. Highly recommend to anyone looking for a reliable and professional lawyer.","author":"","url":"https://victorialaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'velletta-pedersen-christie-lawyers-victoria' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Vick Hundal was highly professional from the first time we spoke on the phone through to my trial. He represented me with maximum effort. Thanks to Mr. Hundal, my charges were dismissed.","author":"Raman G.","url":"https://vickhundallaw.ca/"},{"text":"Vick Hundal was the right criminal defence lawyer to protect my rights. He came highly recommended and he followed through with all of his promises.","author":"Adam K.","url":"https://vickhundallaw.ca/"},{"text":"Mr. Hundal fought my legal battle with honesty. He did not let me down and during the proceedings. He kept me updated on the proceedings and was always available to answer any questions. Thank you Vick for all of your help!","author":"Junaid Q.","url":"https://vickhundallaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'vick-hundal-brampton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I am very grateful for Igor Vilkhov guidance and support throughout my case. Their professionalism, knowledge, and responsiveness made a difficult situation much easier to navigate. I highly recommend their services to anyone needing a skilled and trustworthy lawyer.","author":"","url":"https://vilkhovlaw.ca/"},{"text":"My son was facing an extremely serious charge that could’ve ruined his future. Igor and his team handled the matter so well that my son walked away a free man. I honestly can’t thank him enough for his very very hard work. All the way from Orillia. Thank you Igor!!!","author":"","url":"https://vilkhovlaw.ca/"},{"text":"I express my deep gratitude to Igor Vilkhov for his work on my case. He did a great job and achieved a fair outcome and the dismissal of all charges against me. Igor was in constant contact, kept me informed of every step, and was ready to answer any questions I had.","author":"","url":"https://vilkhovlaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'vilkhov-law-professional-corporation-toronto' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Great office who took on our file at short notice and did a superlative job completing it","author":"","url":"https://vincentmarklaw.ca/"},{"text":"One of the most amazing and my first experience with a lawyer went amazing. They were extremely helpful. I''ll recommend it 100 percent.","author":"","url":"https://vincentmarklaw.ca/"},{"text":"I had a fantastic experience working with Aikay Vincent Oduoza on transferring the mortgage for a property. We ran into unprecedented challenges with the land title office (due to issues on my behalf), but Aikay went above and beyond to help us get the job done.","author":"","url":"https://vincentmarklaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'vincent-mark-law-corporation-burnaby' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Lawyer Khaled Wahab was very helpful in getting our affidavit completed. Although we approached him at the last minute, he was very professional and accommodating. He took time to understanding the matter and handled the whole process carefully and efficiently. I really appreciate his patience and guidance. Highly Recommended!!","author":"","url":"https://wahablaw.com/"},{"text":"I had a very positive experience with Wahab Law regarding an estate litigation matter. They handled the situation with professionalism, care, and attention to detail. Their guidance made a complex legal process much easier to understand and navigate. Would definitely recommend Wahab Law, best people working, with the utmost respect and drive to help people in the best way possible.","author":"","url":"https://wahablaw.com/"},{"text":"Thank you to the wahab team for helping me with my case. Professional, responsive, and knowledgeable throughout. Highly recommend.","author":"","url":"https://wahablaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'wahab-law-kitchener' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Thank you so very much Paul. I could not have done it without all of your unwavering support, guidance and dedication. Your expertise and advice have been invaluable throughout this process and you have given us a future with promise and hope. You have my highest regard and I wish you all the very best.” Barry Perreault Former Client","author":"","url":"https://warnetthallen.com/?utm_source=local&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp_vancouver"},{"text":"The best thing you can do after a car wreck is contact a lawyer… signing on with Warnett Hallen LLP in Vancouver is the best thing I’ve ever done for myself. I swear to god. I just went in to see a doctor and for the first time I didn’t feel heard or listened to.","author":"","url":"https://warnetthallen.com/?utm_source=local&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp_vancouver"},{"text":"Working with Manjot has been critical to my amenable settlement. He preached patience when ICBC was pressuring to close the case early. His experience with handling discoveries, negotiations, obtaining supporting evidence, and presenting a formidable dossier to ICBC was invaluable. Manjot’s services were exactly what I required for my injury claim. His practice is ethical, transparent, personable, and accurate.","author":"","url":"https://warnetthallen.com/?utm_source=local&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp_vancouver"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'warnett-hallen-llp' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"David Sowemimo was extremely helpful with my case. He was very personable and took the time to explain everything to me. I felt confident that he had my best interests at heart and worked to get the best settlement. All the staff were easy to deal with and made the entire experience better.","author":"","url":"https://watchmakerlaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'watchmaker-law-car-accident-and-personal-injury-lawyers-edmonton' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"One of the greatest compliments West Legal can receive from our satisfied clients, aside from seeing them come back year after year, is to have them recommend us to their family and friends. We recognize that when our clients retain us to complete a legal transaction or resolve a legal issue, they are inviting us... Read More","author":"Jonathan M.","url":"https://www.west-legal.ca/reviews/"},{"text":"Working with Sabrina was an absolute pleasure. She went above and beyond for my client throughout the entire process and made what could have been a very difficult deal with a builder so much smoother and less stressful.","author":"","url":"https://www.west-legal.ca/reviews/"},{"text":"Kim recently helped me with an employment matter, and I’m incredibly grateful to have found her. From the start, she was kind and truly went above and beyond my expectations. Her knowledge and attention to detail gave me so much confidence throughout the process. She was also very responsive, always getting back to me quickly.","author":"","url":"https://www.west-legal.ca/reviews/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'west-legal-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"My partner and I recently worked with Westcoast Wills and Estates to prepare our wills, powers of attorney, and representation agreements, and we couldn’t be happier with the experience. Bronte was absolutely fantastic–personable, professional, and incredibly thorough.","author":"","url":"https://westcoastwills.com/"},{"text":"I definitely would suggest Westcoast Wills & Estates if you are needing assistance with your estate. Throughout the process, they cared for me like family. Professional, thorough, organized and super friendly. They carefully walk you through all the required steps. I would specifically recommend Mudit or Jessica to help you.","author":"","url":"https://westcoastwills.com/"},{"text":"Jackson Sinclair and his support team are great to deal with. He assisted both my elderly mother and disabled brother through the process of updating/preparing all documentation necessary and appropriate for their later years and end of life wishes, and did so respect and compassion.","author":"","url":"https://westcoastwills.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'westcoast-wills-and-estates-vancouver' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Our Lawyer, Muthana Mohamed, was a pleasure to work with. He handled both the sale and purchase of our homes and everything went very smoothly. We had a discrepancy with our new house that we may have ignored but on his advice, we were able to recover our loss very quickly and efficiently.","author":"","url":"https://whitestonelaw.ca/"},{"text":"I had the pleasure of hiring Muthana as my lawyer. He was great at keeping me up to date and he was on top of everything. The customer service was incredible and the knowledge he shared throughout the process even through the difficult parts easier to digest and understand the options we had.","author":"","url":"https://whitestonelaw.ca/"},{"text":"Muthana assisted us for both selling and buying our new home. The process was smooth and Muthana basically took care of the legal documents on behalf with timely manner. Always kept us up to date with everything required for closing. Would definitely recommend Muthana to friends and family for real estate transactions. \" Syed Rezwanul Huq","author":"","url":"https://whitestonelaw.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'whitestone-law-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"Best in the Business! Best in the business!! Had the pleasure of working with Robin Jawanda, Karen Aujla & Dharm Dhillon with my own business as well as my clients business. They go above and beyond for their clients and provide the best service and professionalism. Highly recommend firm for all your needs.","author":"Jag B.","url":"https://wilsonrasmussen.com/"},{"text":"Clear, Concise Advice I''ve worked with several capable law offices in my life, but this firm truly stands out. Their clear, concise advice and responsive actions are exceptional. I cannot say enough good things about this outstanding team.","author":"Gerry L.","url":"https://wilsonrasmussen.com/"},{"text":"Legal Guidance Without the Stress Robin Jawanda and Dharam Dhillon are exceptional lawyers. Their expertise in real estate and contracts have made my life stress-free. They are thorough, responsive, and always have their clients'' best interests in mind. Highly recommend!","author":"Mandeep H.","url":"https://wilsonrasmussen.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'wilson-rasmussen-llp-surrey' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I was well served by this firm. I highly appreciated the friendly atmosphere and quality work I received from Bianca. I would recommend this firm for my friends. Sittelbenat Adem “ Quality Work","author":"","url":"https://www.wvglaw.com/"},{"text":"Knowledgeable team who communicate clearly. I feel that I was treated fairly and every concern that I had was dealt with professionally. If I have the need for a lawyer again, this team will be my first and only call. Thank you for all of your help. Caroline Bard “ Knowledgeable team","author":"","url":"https://www.wvglaw.com/"},{"text":"Justin is thorough and efficient. He spent time both over the phone and in person when we needed to answer all of our questions He took the time to explain some questions about future possibilities. I have highly recommended his services to friends and family. Thanks to you and your team. Kris “ Thorough and efficient","author":"","url":"https://www.wvglaw.com/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'wvgb-personal-injury-lawyers-ottawa' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
UPDATE firms SET data = json_set(data, '$.comments', json('[{"text":"I''m extremely satisfied with the council that I was given as well as Mr Wyman''s ability to adapt and overcome changing circumstances while achieving the desired outcome. Thank you so much for everything!","author":"Chris L.","url":"https://criminallawyercalgary.ca/"},{"text":"James was extremely professional. He was available 24/7 to answer my questions and communicated the situation clearly and got me the best possible outcome. He always made me feel like I was a priority even tho he had many other clients. I highly appreciate and recommend him. Thank you James you truly are a wonderful lawyer and person.","author":"Stephanie L.","url":"https://criminallawyercalgary.ca/"},{"text":"Mr. James Wyman, Over the last six years you have been involved with my former foster child, “J”, as he has struggled with various aspects of the legal system. I feel it is important to acknowledge my sincere gratitude and admiration regarding your qualities of professionalism, advocacy and, most important, compassion.","author":"","url":"https://criminallawyercalgary.ca/"}]')), updated_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'wyman-and-williamson-criminal-defence-lawyers-calgary' AND COALESCE(json_extract(data, '$.commentsOff'), 0) = 0;
